HIM, OF COURSE, SURE.

151
00:08:28,776 --> 00:08:29,977
WOW.
YEAH.

152
00:08:30,010 --> 00:08:31,579
A LOT OF PEOPLE
DON'T REALIZE THIS,

153
00:08:31,612 --> 00:08:34,514
BUT YOU CAN PUT
YOUR WEED IN THERE.

154
00:08:34,548 --> 00:08:35,883
OH.
[ CHUCKLES ][ CHUCKLES ]

