00:27:17,670 --> 00:27:18,971
[ BUZZES ]

499
00:27:19,005 --> 00:27:20,039
OW!

500
00:27:20,239 --> 00:27:22,875
AAH!

501
00:27:22,909 --> 00:27:25,845
[ GRUNTING ]

502
00:27:26,045 --> 00:27:26,946
OH!

503
00:27:26,979 --> 00:27:28,047
GROSS.

504
00:27:28,080 --> 00:27:29,515
[ BUZZING ]

505
00:27:29,548 --> 00:27:31,784
AGH!

506
00:27:31,818 --> 00:27:33,720
I'VE GOT HAIR
EVERYWHERE --

507
00:27:33,753 --> 00:27:37,389
IN MY NOSE, IN MY EARS,
ON MY CHIN.

508
00:27:37,423 --> 00:27:39,225
I'M AFRAID TO LOOK
ANYWHERE ELSE.

509
00:27:39,258 --> 00:27:40,793
[ SHUDDERS ]

510
00:27:40,827 --> 00:27:42,628
IT'S LIKE I'M AN AD
FOR HAIR.

511
00:27:42,661 --> 00:27:45,898
OKAY, WELL, LISTEN,
MAYBE THIS WILL HELP.

512
00:27:45,932 --> 00:27:48,901
OKAY.

513
00:27:48,935 --> 00:27:52,138
AHH...

514
00:27:52,171 --> 00:27:53,906
YEAH.

515
00:27:53,940 --> 00:27:56,308
OKAY.
AGAINST THE GRAIN.

516
00:27:56,342 --> 00:27:57,543
OKAY, READY?
MM-HMM.

517
00:27:57,576 --> 00:27:59,311
HOLD STILL.

518
00:27:59,345 --> 00:28:00,412
[ RIP ]
AAAH!

519
00:28:00,446 --> 00:28:03,950
GRRRAH! AGH!

520
00:28:06,085 --> 00:28:07,519
OW.

521
00:28:07,553 --> 00:28:09,822
UH...

522
00:28:09,856 --> 00:28:11,924
OW.

523
00:28:11,958 --> 00:28:13,692
SO...

524
00:28:13,726 --> 00:28:15,194
[ GRUNTS ]

525
00:28:17,296 --> 00:28:20,099
SO, UH...

526
00:28:22,234 --> 00:28:23,569
WHAT?

527
00:28:23,602 --> 00:28:26,605
DO YOU REALLY HAVE
A PENIS?

528
00:28:28,440 --> 00:28:29,842
APRIL!

529
00:28:29,876 --> 00:28:31,911
CAN I SEE IT?

530
00:28:31,944 --> 00:28:34,013
WHAT IS THE MATTER
WITH YOU?!

531
00:28:34,046 --> 00:28:37,349
I DON'T THINK YOU GET THE
GRAVITY OF THE SITUATION HERE.

532
00:28:37,383 --> 00:28:40,552
YOU'RE RIGHT.
YOU'RE RIGHT. I'M SORRY.

533
00:28:40,586 --> 00:28:41,754
I'M SORRY.

534
00:28:43,089 --> 00:28:44,090
CAN I SEE IT?

535
00:28:44,123 --> 00:28:46,692
W-- WHAT IS YOUR PROBLEM?

536
00:28:46,725 --> 00:28:48,094
WHAT?

537
00:28:48,127 --> 00:28:50,629
IT'S NOT EVERY DAY
THAT YOUR BEST FRIEND
GROWS A PENIS.

538
00:28:51,563 --> 00:28:52,932
DO YOU WANT TO SEE IT?

539
00:28:54,633 --> 00:28:56,602
OKAY, FINE --

540
00:28:56,635 --> 00:28:59,171
IF IT'LL SHUT YOU UP.

541
00:29:07,279 --> 00:29:09,081
[ LAUGHS ]

542
00:29:09,115 --> 00:29:10,817
[ MUTTERS ]

543
00:29:10,850 --> 00:29:12,651
NICE.

544
00:29:12,684 --> 00:29:15,421
NICE.

545
00:29:16,856 --> 00:29:18,991
I MEAN, YOU KNOW...

546
00:29:19,025 --> 00:29:22,895
I'VE ONLY SEEN A COUPLE,
BUT THAT'S DEFINITELY TOP 5.

547
00:29:22,929 --> 00:29:25,097
HOW MANY HAVE YOU SEEN?

548
00:29:25,131 --> 00:29:26,398
FIVE.

549
00:29:26,432 --> 00:29:28,300
NOT INCLUDING
MY LITTLE BROTHER'S.

550
00:29:28,334 --> 00:29:29,401
[ LAUGHS ]

551
00:29:29,435 --> 00:29:31,938
YOU LITTLE TRAMP!

552
00:29:31,971 --> 00:29:32,905
AAH!

553
00:29:32,939 --> 00:29:34,841
[ Laughing ] AAH! AAH!

554
00:29:34,874 --> 00:29:36,475
AAH!

555
00:29:37,309 --> 00:29:38,410
AAAH!

556
00:29:38,444 --> 00:29:39,812
AAH! AAH!

557
00:29:40,012 --> 00:29:41,247
OH! OH! OH!

558
00:29:41,280 --> 00:29:45,051
OH, MOTHERFUCK! OH!

559
00:29:46,953 --> 00:29:48,420
STAN...

560
00:29:48,454 --> 00:29:50,656
I AM BEGINNING TO WORRY
ABOUT APRIL.

561
00:29:50,689 --> 00:29:52,825
SHE HAS BEEN ACTING
RATHER STRANGE.

562
00:29:53,025 --> 00:29:54,961
IS IT DRUGS?
NO, NO.

563
00:29:55,161 --> 00:29:58,530
I...I THINK IT'S
HER HORMONAL DEVELOPMENT.

564
00:29:58,564 --> 00:30:01,800
SHE JUST ATE SIX
PEANUT-BUTTER-AND-JELLY
SANDWICHES

565
00:30:01,834 --> 00:30:04,336
AND AN ENTIRE CARTON
OF ICE CREAM.

566
00:30:06,839 --> 00:30:09,108
AND WHAT DO YOU MAKE
OF THIS, HMM?

567
00:30:09,141 --> 00:30:10,943
IT'S APRIL'S SOAP.

568
00:30:10,977 --> 00:30:12,611
WELL?

569
00:30:12,644 --> 00:30:14,180
WHAT DO YOU THINK?

570
00:30:14,213 --> 00:30:17,917
I THINK YOU NEED MORE THINGS
TO FILL OUT YOUR DAY.

571
00:30:20,352 --> 00:30:22,021
OKAY?

572
00:30:22,054 --> 00:30:23,322
ARE WE DONE?

573
00:30:27,526 --> 00:30:28,660
[ LAUGHS ]

574
00:30:28,694 --> 00:30:31,864
[ CELLULAR PHONE RINGS ]

575
00:30:31,898 --> 00:30:33,032
[ BEEP ]

576
00:30:33,065 --> 00:30:34,166
HELLO?

577
00:30:34,200 --> 00:30:36,535
[ Jessica crying in deep voice ]

578
00:30:36,568 --> 00:30:38,270
ALL RIGHT, WHO IS THIS?

579
00:30:40,106 --> 00:30:43,642
I SHOULD HAVE MADE LOVE TO YOU
WHEN I HAD THE CHANCE.

580
00:30:43,675 --> 00:30:45,211
OHHH...

581
00:30:47,246 --> 00:30:49,115
FATHER MULCAHY?

582
00:30:50,282 --> 00:30:52,384
[ BEEP ]

583
00:30:52,418 --> 00:30:55,621
[ CHILDREN SHOUTING PLAYFULLY ]

584
00:30:59,791 --> 00:31:00,993
[ GASPS ]

585
00:31:01,027 --> 00:31:03,429
[ High-pitched ]
TELL ME I'M BEAUTIFUL.

586
00:31:04,931 --> 00:31:07,599
ON THE INSIDE.

587
00:31:10,402 --> 00:31:12,071
LOOK, UH...

588
00:31:12,104 --> 00:31:14,506
JESSICA HAS A PROBLEM.

589
00:31:14,540 --> 00:31:16,875
SHE'S ONLY GONNA MAKE US
WAIT AN HOUR THIS TIME?

590
00:31:16,909 --> 00:31:19,178
WHAT ABOUT THE CLASS TRIP
TO SIX FLAGS?

591
00:31:19,211 --> 00:31:21,780
SHE TOOK SO LONG
IN THE BATHROOM, WE
ALL MISSED THE BUS.

592
00:31:21,813 --> 00:31:24,616
OUR PARENTS HAD TO DRIVE
THREE HOURS TO PICK US UP.

593
00:31:24,650 --> 00:31:27,987
I HAD MY PERIOD, OKAY?!

594
00:31:33,625 --> 00:31:35,427
[ GASPS ]
[ GASPS ][ GASPS ]

595
00:31:35,461 --> 00:31:37,796
[ LAUGHING ]
[ LAUGHING ][ LAUGHING ]

596
00:31:41,433 --> 00:31:43,602
OKAY, NOW THAT EVERYBODY'S
UP TO SPEED,

597
00:31:43,635 --> 00:31:46,072
CAN WE START THINKING
ABOUT HOW I CAN GET
MY LIFE BACK?

598
00:31:46,105 --> 00:31:49,275
UM, THAT'S DEFINITELY
GONNA COST YOU A FEW
VOTES FOR PROM QUEEN.

599
00:31:49,308 --> 00:31:50,242
YEAH.

600
00:31:50,276 --> 00:31:51,677
[ LAUGHTER ]

601
00:31:52,945 --> 00:31:54,413
OKAY.

602
00:31:54,446 --> 00:31:56,748
COME ON, YOU GUYS,
LET'S GET SERIOUS.
STOP DICKING AROUND.

603
00:31:56,782 --> 00:31:58,550
[ LAUGHTER ]

604
00:31:58,584 --> 00:32:00,919
GUYS!

605
00:32:00,953 --> 00:32:04,223
I'VE GOT CHEERLEADING
COMPETITION, THE PROM.

606
00:32:04,256 --> 00:32:06,993
NONE OF MY CLOTHES FIT.
I THINK I'M GOING BALD.

607
00:32:07,193 --> 00:32:09,128
AND HOW AM I GONNA GO
TO SCHOOL?

608
00:32:09,161 --> 00:32:10,929
SHE'S RIGHT.

609
00:32:10,963 --> 00:32:12,298
OKAY...

610
00:32:12,331 --> 00:32:14,000
LET'S THINK.

611
00:32:14,033 --> 00:32:16,802
WHAT COULD HAVE
CAUSED THIS?

612
00:32:22,374 --> 00:32:25,311
[ GASPS ] MAYBE IT WASN'T
AN ACCIDENT.

613
00:32:27,846 --> 00:32:30,149
IT'S GOTTA BE ONE
OF THE PEOPLE WHO HATES
JESSICA THAT DID THIS.

614
00:32:30,182 --> 00:32:31,250
YEAH.

615
00:32:31,283 --> 00:32:32,318
WHAT ARE YOU
TALKING ABOUT?

616
00:32:33,452 --> 00:32:35,054
PEOPLE DON'T HATE ME.

617
00:32:38,657 --> 00:32:40,459
[ EXHALES DEEPLY ]

618
00:32:40,492 --> 00:32:42,594
YOU SEE, JESS...

619
00:32:42,628 --> 00:32:45,864
BECAUSE YOU ARE
SO BEAUTIFUL AND PERFECT...

620
00:32:45,897 --> 00:32:47,366
UH-HUH?

621
00:32:47,566 --> 00:32:49,501
...CERTAIN PEOPLE
MIGHT MISCONSTRUE

622
00:32:49,701 --> 00:32:52,938
SOME OF THE MEAN AND HURTFUL
THINGS YOU SAY AND DO TO THEM.

623
00:32:52,971 --> 00:32:55,774
ALTHOUGH THE THINGS
YOU SAY ARE FUNNY...

624
00:32:55,807 --> 00:32:57,009
[ LAUGHS ]

625
00:32:57,043 --> 00:32:59,278
...PEOPLE
TEND TO FOCUS MORE

626
00:32:59,311 --> 00:33:02,314
ON THEIR OWN
PUBLIC HUMILIATION AND SHAME.

627
00:33:02,348 --> 00:33:04,616
SO YOU'RE SAYING...

628
00:33:04,650 --> 00:33:06,452
PEOPLE THINK...

629
00:33:06,485 --> 00:33:07,686
I'M PERFECT?

630
00:33:09,488 --> 00:33:12,224
LET'S MAKE A LIST
OF ALL THE PEOPLE
WHO HATE JESSICA.

631
00:33:12,258 --> 00:33:14,526
YOU KNOW WHAT WOULD BE
A SHORTER LIST?

632
00:33:14,560 --> 00:33:17,229
ALL THE PEOPLE
WHO DON'T HATE JESSICA.

633
00:33:17,263 --> 00:33:18,030
[ LAUGHTER ]

634
00:33:18,064 --> 00:33:19,231
YOU BITCH!

635
00:33:20,999 --> 00:33:24,603
[ ALL SCREAMING AND LAUGHING ]

636
00:33:27,606 --> 00:33:29,941
[ SCREAMING AND LAUGHTER
CONTINUE IN DISTANCE ]

637
00:33:31,943 --> 00:33:35,081
EASY ON THE COFFEE.

638
00:33:35,114 --> 00:33:38,550
[ ALL LAUGHING ]

639
00:33:38,584 --> 00:33:39,985
HA HA HA HA!

640
00:33:40,018 --> 00:33:41,253
HO HO HO!

641
00:33:41,953 --> 00:33:43,889
UGH!
OHH!

642
00:33:43,922 --> 00:33:45,557
[ CHUCKLES ]

643
00:33:45,591 --> 00:33:46,225
UGH!

644
00:33:46,258 --> 00:33:47,426
[ GASPS ]

645
00:33:47,459 --> 00:33:48,927
UGH!
AAH!

646
00:33:48,960 --> 00:33:49,961
HA HA HA!

647
00:33:50,462 --> 00:33:51,830
AAH!

648
00:33:51,863 --> 00:33:53,232
HA HA HA-HA-HA-HA-HA!

649
00:33:53,265 --> 00:33:54,032
[ GASPS ]

650
00:33:55,434 --> 00:33:57,769
UGH!
AGH!

651
00:33:57,803 --> 00:34:00,272
[ LAUGHING ]

652
00:34:05,777 --> 00:34:06,778
[ GULPS ]

653
00:34:23,895 --> 00:34:25,597
HUH?

654
00:34:25,631 --> 00:34:26,932
OH, HI.

655
00:34:26,965 --> 00:34:28,367
GOOD MORNING.

656
00:34:28,400 --> 00:34:29,601
[ GROANS ]

657
00:34:29,635 --> 00:34:31,537
DID YOU SLEEP WELL?

658
00:34:31,570 --> 00:34:34,606
MMM.
SURPRISINGLY, YES.

659
00:34:36,775 --> 00:34:38,877
YOU HAVE ANY...

660
00:34:38,910 --> 00:34:40,912
SPECIAL DREAMS?

661
00:34:42,148 --> 00:34:43,915
NOT PARTICULARLY.

662
00:34:43,949 --> 00:34:45,451
HMM.

663
00:34:45,651 --> 00:34:46,752
YOU SURE?

664
00:34:46,785 --> 00:34:49,288
WHY?

665
00:34:54,326 --> 00:34:56,262
OH, MY GOD,
MY FIRST BONER!

666
00:34:56,295 --> 00:34:57,429
[ GIGGLES ]

667
00:34:59,198 --> 00:35:01,800
[ BRAKES SQUEAL ]

668
00:35:07,139 --> 00:35:08,774
Richie: THERE YOU ARE!
AH!

669
00:35:08,807 --> 00:35:10,309
YOU'RE THE GARDENER
FROM THE SERVICE, RIGHT?

670
00:35:11,843 --> 00:35:13,412
[ Mexican accent ] Sí.

671
00:35:13,445 --> 00:35:15,414
DAMN LAWN'S A MESS.

672
00:35:15,447 --> 00:35:17,816
IT'S MY DAUGHTER'S
RESPONSIBILITY
TO LOOK AFTER IT,

673
00:35:17,849 --> 00:35:19,017
BUT YOU KNOW TEENAGE GIRLS.

674
00:35:19,050 --> 00:35:20,352
Sí, Sí.

675
00:35:20,552 --> 00:35:22,421
"TEENAGEROS."

676
00:35:22,454 --> 00:35:24,956
SORRY. RICHIE SPENCER.

677
00:35:24,990 --> 00:35:28,760
AH, UM...

678
00:35:28,794 --> 00:35:30,095
TAQUITO.

679
00:35:30,128 --> 00:35:31,930
OH, TAQUITO.

680
00:35:31,963 --> 00:35:33,632
THERE'S THE MOWER.

681
00:35:33,665 --> 00:35:35,934
THERE'S YOUR BAG
OF FERTILIZER.

682
00:35:35,967 --> 00:35:38,036
OH, HO! [ GASPING ]
I'LL LET YOU GET TO IT.

683
00:35:38,069 --> 00:35:40,138
[ SALSA MUSIC PLAYS ]

684
00:35:54,186 --> 00:35:57,823
DAMN, I LOVE THE SMELL
OF FRESH-CUT GRASS.

685
00:36:00,426 --> 00:36:02,561
[ AIR HISSES ]

686
00:36:02,594 --> 00:36:05,964
GRACIAS, BUT...I'M NOT SURE
I'M OLD ENOUGH, SEÑOR.

687
00:36:05,997 --> 00:36:07,399
[ Laughing ] YEAH, RIGHT.

688
00:36:07,433 --> 00:36:10,236
WHAT IS THE DRINKING AGE
IN MEXICO -- 40?

689
00:36:10,269 --> 00:36:13,104
COME ON, TAKE A LOAD OFF.
YOU CAN FINISH IN A MINUTE.

690
00:36:15,607 --> 00:36:16,908
[ SIGHS ]

691
00:36:16,942 --> 00:36:18,677
HOPE YOU DON'T MIND
THE LIGHT BEER.

692
00:36:18,710 --> 00:36:20,412
I HAD TO CUT BACK
ON ACCOUNT OF THE BLOATING.

693
00:36:20,446 --> 00:36:22,314
KNOW WHAT I MEAN?

694
00:36:22,348 --> 00:36:24,516
I ALSO HAD TO GIVE UP
THE SPICY FOOD ON
ACCOUNT OF MY ASSHOLE.

695
00:36:24,550 --> 00:36:25,551
[ FARTS ]

696
00:36:25,584 --> 00:36:26,885
AH!

697
00:36:26,918 --> 00:36:29,388
WE'RE AMONGST MEN,
AREN'T WE?

698
00:36:29,421 --> 00:36:31,423
[ BREATHES DEEPLY ]

699
00:36:31,457 --> 00:36:33,525
"STINKO DE MAYO."

700
00:36:33,559 --> 00:36:34,593
YOU LIKE THAT CAR?

701
00:36:34,626 --> 00:36:36,094
THAT'S MY DAUGHTER'S.

702
00:36:36,127 --> 00:36:37,496
PRETTY NICE, HUH?

703
00:36:37,529 --> 00:36:39,197
IT WOULD HAVE LOOKED
EVEN BETTER IN RED.

704
00:36:39,231 --> 00:36:41,933
THAT'S WHAT
MY DAUGHTER SAID.

705
00:36:43,402 --> 00:36:46,037
WE USED TO GO OUT
BACK ON SUNDAYS AND
TOSS A FEW BASKETS,

706
00:36:46,071 --> 00:36:47,539
SHOOT THE SHIT.

707
00:36:47,573 --> 00:36:49,575
BUT SHE'S GOT HER OWN STUFF
GOING ON NOW.

708
00:36:49,608 --> 00:36:51,943
WHO COULD BLAME HER?
WHOLE FAMILY'S FALLING APART.

709
00:36:51,977 --> 00:36:54,179
WHAT?

710
00:36:54,212 --> 00:36:56,582
THINGS WITH THE WIFE --
FORGET ABOUT IT.

711
00:36:56,615 --> 00:36:58,750
I MEAN,
WE SLEEP IN THE SAME BED.

712
00:36:58,784 --> 00:37:01,119
MIGHT AS WELL BE
SEPARATE COUNTRIES.

713
00:37:01,152 --> 00:37:04,756
THAT IS, LIKE, SO SAD.

714
00:37:06,057 --> 00:37:07,893
AY-YI-YI!

715
00:37:07,926 --> 00:37:09,928
AY-YI...YI.

716
00:37:10,128 --> 00:37:13,098
I TRIED EVERYTHING.
NOTHING WORKED.

717
00:37:13,131 --> 00:37:15,601
I EVEN GOT OUT THE
RAZOR AND GAVE MYSELF
A PORN-STAR TRIM.

718
00:37:15,634 --> 00:37:17,869
WANNA SEE?
CHECK IT OUT.

719
00:37:17,903 --> 00:37:19,104
AAH!

720
00:37:20,472 --> 00:37:22,741
BOY, SHE USED TO BE WILD.

721
00:37:22,774 --> 00:37:24,643
THE SEX WAS GREAT.

722
00:37:24,676 --> 00:37:26,912
WE'D BE GOING AT IT,
AND SHE COULD STILL FIND A WAY

723
00:37:26,945 --> 00:37:28,614
TO TWIST AROUND
AND KISS ME ON THE MOUTH.

724
00:37:28,647 --> 00:37:31,717
SEÑOR,
INFORMATION TOO MUCHO.

725
00:37:31,750 --> 00:37:34,453
EMOTIONAL "SCARRO" --
DISGUSTING.

726
00:37:34,486 --> 00:37:36,087
IT'S GOOD TALKING TO YOU,
TAQUITO.

727
00:37:36,121 --> 00:37:37,823
OH!

728
00:37:37,856 --> 00:37:42,227
[ INTRODUCTION TO
JIMMY EAT WORLD'S
"AUTHORITY SONG" PLAYS ]

729
00:37:42,260 --> 00:37:44,262
* IT'S HOW THE HUSTLE GOES

730
00:37:44,296 --> 00:37:47,299
* SEE WHAT THE JUKEBOX KNOWS

731
00:37:49,535 --> 00:37:51,903
* PUT MY LAST QUARTER ON

732
00:37:51,937 --> 00:37:54,506
* I PLAY "AUTHORITY SONG"

733
00:37:58,143 --> 00:38:01,012
* HONESTY OR MYSTERY?

734
00:38:01,046 --> 00:38:03,749
* TELL ME,
I'M NOT SCARED ANYMORE *

735
00:38:03,782 --> 00:38:05,484
* AHA, AHA

736
00:38:05,517 --> 00:38:07,486
* I GOT NO SECRET PURPOSE

737
00:38:07,519 --> 00:38:09,087
* I DON'T SEEM OBVIOUS, DO I?

738
00:38:09,120 --> 00:38:11,357
Hey, Jessica! Jessica!

739
00:38:11,390 --> 00:38:12,691
Come here!

740
00:38:12,891 --> 00:38:14,159
[ PANTING ]

741
00:38:14,192 --> 00:38:16,428
We've got a suspect.

742
00:38:16,462 --> 00:38:18,096
OH, YES!

743
00:38:18,129 --> 00:38:19,798
COME ON.

744
00:38:22,300 --> 00:38:24,803
SOMETHING SMELLS
LIKE DOG POOH.

745
00:38:24,836 --> 00:38:27,439
I THINK
I'M SITTING NEXT TO IT.

746
00:38:27,473 --> 00:38:30,208
EW!
[ LAUGHTER ]

747
00:38:30,241 --> 00:38:32,778
April: COME ON, HILDENBURG,
DON'T PLAY DUMB.

748
00:38:32,811 --> 00:38:35,781
YOU HATE JESSICA, YOU'RE GOOD
AT THIS SCIENCE CRAP.

749
00:38:35,814 --> 00:38:38,116
NOW, JUST CONFESS
AND GIVE US THE ANTIDOTE.

750
00:38:38,149 --> 00:38:40,018
APRIL, IT'S
PHYSICALLY IMPOSSIBLE

751
00:38:40,051 --> 00:38:42,187
FOR A WOMAN TO TRANSFORM
INTO A MAN OVERNIGHT.

752
00:38:42,220 --> 00:38:45,657
SO YOU'RE SAYING THAT YOU
HAD NOTHING TO DO WITH THIS.

753
00:38:45,691 --> 00:38:47,493
LOOK...

754
00:38:47,526 --> 00:38:50,462
LET'S JUST PRETEND THIS WAS
AN ALTERNATE UNIVERSE

755
00:38:50,496 --> 00:38:53,164
WHERE I ACTUALLY
BELIEVED YOU.

756
00:38:53,198 --> 00:38:56,368
WHY WOULD I WANT TO HELP
JESSICA OUT, ANYWAY?

757
00:38:57,603 --> 00:38:59,505
[ SCOFFS, SNIFFS ]

758
00:38:59,538 --> 00:39:00,839
JESSICA!

759
00:39:00,872 --> 00:39:02,741
[ SIGHS ]

760
00:39:07,112 --> 00:39:08,780
HILDENBURG...
[ SIGHS ]

761
00:39:10,782 --> 00:39:13,385
I'M SORRY
THAT I HUMILIATED YOU

762
00:39:13,419 --> 00:39:16,021
IN FRONT OF
THE ENTIRE SCHOOL...

763
00:39:16,054 --> 00:39:18,524
AND THE VISITING
8th-GRADERS.

764
00:39:20,291 --> 00:39:25,531
[ Voice breaking ] BUT YOU
HAVE NO IDEA WHAT IT'S LIKE

765
00:39:25,564 --> 00:39:30,636
TO WAKE UP EVERY MORNING
AND HAVE TO SHAVE YOUR CHIN.

766
00:39:30,869 --> 00:39:32,103
[ SNIFFLES ]

767
00:39:32,137 --> 00:39:33,705
[ SNORTING ]

768
00:39:35,907 --> 00:39:38,577
[ EXHALES SHARPLY ]

769
00:39:38,610 --> 00:39:40,546
[ Voice breaking ]
YES, I DO.

770
00:39:42,080 --> 00:39:44,616
[ SOBS ]

771
00:39:47,052 --> 00:39:48,153
[ SIGHS DEEPLY ]

772
00:39:48,386 --> 00:39:50,422
WHO'S NEXT ON THE LIST?

773
00:39:50,456 --> 00:39:52,190
[ LAUGHS ] WHOA.

774
00:39:52,223 --> 00:39:55,260
WELL, IT IS COLD IN HERE.

775
00:39:55,293 --> 00:39:56,895
[ LAUGHS ]

776
00:39:56,928 --> 00:39:58,430
SO YOU NEVER PUT
A HEX ON ME?

777
00:39:58,464 --> 00:40:00,298
OH, I PUT PLENTY
OF HEXES ON YOU --

778
00:40:00,331 --> 00:40:03,368
TO GIVE YOU DANDRUFF,
MAKE YOUR HAIR FALL OUT,

779
00:40:03,401 --> 00:40:06,071
MAKE ONE OF YOUR BOOBS
BIGGER THAN THE OTHER.

780
00:40:06,104 --> 00:40:08,406
[ Laughing ] OH, I THINK
YOU GOT ME WITH THAT ONE.

781
00:40:08,440 --> 00:40:10,942
HEH HEE HEE!
AH HEE HEE!

782
00:40:12,511 --> 00:40:14,713
[ LIGHT LAUGHTER ]

783
00:40:14,746 --> 00:40:18,817
THERE'S SOME POWERFUL
CULT MAGIC AT WORK HERE...

784
00:40:19,017 --> 00:40:20,819
LIKE AN ANCIENT SPELL...

785
00:40:20,852 --> 00:40:22,387
OR VOODOO...

786
00:40:22,420 --> 00:40:24,790
OR SANTERIA.

787
00:40:24,823 --> 00:40:26,925
WHAT'S SANTERIA?

788
00:40:26,958 --> 00:40:29,360
IT'S A LATIN-BASED FORM
OF WITCHCRAFT.

789
00:40:29,595 --> 00:40:31,096
IT ORIGINATED IN AFRICA

790
00:40:31,129 --> 00:40:34,466
AND THEN EVENTUALLY
MADE ITS WAY TO CUBA AND BRAZIL.

791
00:40:34,500 --> 00:40:35,967
BIANCA!

792
00:40:36,001 --> 00:40:37,335
I KNEW IT.

793
00:40:37,368 --> 00:40:38,770
MOST OF ITS RITUALS
INVOLVE A CHICKEN.

794
00:40:38,804 --> 00:40:41,172
THAT SOUNDS DELICIOUS.

795
00:40:42,474 --> 00:40:44,576
I MEAN, INTERESTING.

796
00:40:44,610 --> 00:40:46,144
Eden:
THERE'S A WAY TO TELL.

797
00:40:46,177 --> 00:40:48,279
A TRUE PRACTITIONER
OF SANTERIA

798
00:40:48,313 --> 00:40:52,017
BEARS THE MARK OF THE SCORPION
TATTOOED ON THEIR BACK.

799
00:40:52,050 --> 00:40:53,685
BIANCA'S ALWAYS HANGING OUT

800
00:40:53,719 --> 00:40:55,854
AT THAT DANCE CLUB --
INSTANT TANG.

801
00:40:56,054 --> 00:40:58,657
YEAH, TONIGHT'S LADIES' NIGHT,
AND WE ALL GET IN FOR FREE!

802
00:40:58,690 --> 00:41:02,160
[ ALL CHEERING ]

803
00:41:02,360 --> 00:41:04,630
[ CHEERING STOPS ]

804
00:41:04,663 --> 00:41:07,165
WELL, MOST OF US.

805
00:41:07,198 --> 00:41:09,100
TRUST ME --

806
00:41:09,134 --> 00:41:11,937
YOU'LL NEVER GET BIANCA
TO DANCE WITH YOU
LOOKING LIKE THIS.

807
00:41:11,970 --> 00:41:15,707
* OH, YEAH, YOU'RE PRETTY
GOOD-LOOKING FOR A GIRL *

808
00:41:15,741 --> 00:41:18,544
[ GIRLS GASPING ]
* BUT YOUR BACK IS SO BROKEN

809
00:41:18,577 --> 00:41:22,113
* AND THIS FEELING'S
STILL GONNA LINGER ON *

810
00:41:22,147 --> 00:41:24,182
NO...NO...

811
00:41:24,215 --> 00:41:28,453
[ GIRLS GASPING ]
* UNTIL THE YEAR 2525 NOW

812
00:41:28,486 --> 00:41:32,157
NO. MNH-MNH.
* YEAH, YOU'RE PRETTY
GOOD-LOOKING FOR A GIRL *

813
00:41:32,190 --> 00:41:34,192
[ GASPS ]
* YOUR EYES ARE WIDE OPEN

814
00:41:34,225 --> 00:41:36,662
UGH! WHAT IS THAT?

815
00:41:36,695 --> 00:41:39,164
* AND YOUR THOUGHTS HAVE BEEN
STOLEN BY THE BOYS *

816
00:41:39,197 --> 00:41:41,199
NO...NO...NO...

817
00:41:41,232 --> 00:41:44,069
* WHO TOOK YOU OUT AND BOUGHT
YOU EVERYTHING YOU WANT, NOW *

818
00:41:44,102 --> 00:41:47,873
* YEAH, YOU'RE PRETTY
GOOD-LOOKING, OH, YEAH *

819
00:41:47,906 --> 00:41:49,374
[ GIRLS SCREAMING ]

820
00:41:49,407 --> 00:41:53,244
* YOU'RE PRETTY GOOD-LOOKING,
OH, YEAH *

821
00:41:53,278 --> 00:41:55,413
* FOR A GIRL

822
00:42:02,688 --> 00:42:04,022
WHAT?

823
00:42:04,055 --> 00:42:06,892
NOTHING. [ GIGGLES ]

824
00:42:06,925 --> 00:42:08,594
YOU JUST LOOK GOOD.

825
00:42:08,627 --> 00:42:10,061
[ CHUCKLES ]

826
00:42:10,095 --> 00:42:11,062
REALLY?

827
00:42:11,096 --> 00:42:12,631
YEAH.

828
00:42:12,864 --> 00:42:14,365
[ BOTH GIGGLE ]

829
00:42:14,399 --> 00:42:16,401
OKAY. THANKS.

830
00:42:16,434 --> 00:42:18,236
[ LAUGHS ]

831
00:42:18,269 --> 00:42:21,206
NO, SHE'S NOT GONNA...
NO, HE -- SHE'S
NOT GONNA DO IT.

832
00:42:23,742 --> 00:42:24,943
YES, SHE IS.

833
00:42:24,976 --> 00:42:26,745
MMM...

834
00:42:26,778 --> 00:42:28,513
MMM, MMM...

835
00:42:28,546 --> 00:42:29,848
[ SMACKS LIPS ]

836
00:42:29,881 --> 00:42:31,082
MMM...

837
00:42:31,116 --> 00:42:32,918
[ SLURPING ]

838
00:42:32,951 --> 00:42:34,252
WOW!

839
00:42:34,285 --> 00:42:36,387
THAT IS SO GOOD.

840
00:42:37,455 --> 00:42:39,057
T-THAT'S $8.95.

841
00:42:41,793 --> 00:42:42,828
WHAT?

842
00:42:44,229 --> 00:42:46,598
AREN'T YOU JUST GONNA TAKE IT
OUT OF YOUR TIP JAR?

843
00:42:46,632 --> 00:42:47,966
AAH!

844
00:42:47,999 --> 00:42:50,101
[ Choking ] $8.95?
YEAH.

845
00:42:50,135 --> 00:42:51,603
I GOT THAT.

846
00:42:51,637 --> 00:42:54,239
[ ROCK MUSIC PLAYS,
INDISTINCT CONVERSATIONS ]

847
00:42:58,610 --> 00:43:00,411
* WHEN I ROCK LIKE THIS

848
00:43:00,445 --> 00:43:02,480
* ROCK LIKE THIS,
ROCK LIKE THIS *

849
00:43:02,513 --> 00:43:04,415
* WHEN I ROCK LIKE THIS

850
00:43:04,449 --> 00:43:06,251
* WHEN I ROCK LIKE THIS,
IT'S RHYTHM *

851
00:43:06,284 --> 00:43:07,886
* WHEN I ROCK LIKE THIS

852
00:43:07,919 --> 00:43:09,955
* ROCK LIKE THIS,
ROCK LIKE THIS *

853
00:43:09,988 --> 00:43:11,923
* WHEN I ROCK LIKE THIS

854
00:43:11,957 --> 00:43:14,025
* WHEN I ROCK LIKE THIS,
IT'S RHYTHM *

855
00:43:29,274 --> 00:43:31,643
I'LL TAKE
TWO BANANA DAIQUIRIS,

856
00:43:31,843 --> 00:43:33,945
ONE MANGO,
A SLOE-GIN FIZZ,

857
00:43:33,979 --> 00:43:35,513
ONE SLIPPERY NIPPLE,

858
00:43:35,546 --> 00:43:37,182
AND FOR ME,

859
00:43:37,215 --> 00:43:40,118
A SCREAMING ORGASM ON THE BEACH
WITH EXTRA SUGAR ON THE RIM.

860
00:43:40,151 --> 00:43:41,987
YUM!

861
00:43:50,495 --> 00:43:53,765
[ Deep voice ] UH...BETTER
MAKE THAT LAST ONE A BREWSKI.

862
00:43:53,799 --> 00:43:55,667
* WHEN I ROCK LIKE THIS

863
00:43:55,701 --> 00:43:56,968
* ROCK LIKE THIS

864
00:43:57,002 --> 00:43:58,469
DOUBLE BREWSKI.

865
00:43:58,503 --> 00:44:00,138
[ LYRIC'S "YOUNG and SEXY" PLAYS ]

866
00:44:03,474 --> 00:44:06,177
* YOUNG, SEXY

867
00:44:06,211 --> 00:44:08,213
[ High-pitched ]
THEY DIDN'T EVEN CARD ME.

868
00:44:08,246 --> 00:44:10,281
IT'S JUST LIKE CABO.

869
00:44:10,315 --> 00:44:11,516
[ LAUGHTER ]

870
00:44:11,549 --> 00:44:13,318
* YOU KNOW
I'LL CHANGE FOR YOU *

871
00:44:13,351 --> 00:44:17,388
* WITH YOUR BLACK DURAG

872
00:44:17,422 --> 00:44:20,325
HOW DOES A BUTT PLUG
LIKE THAT GET ALL
THOSE HOT CHICKS?

873
00:44:20,358 --> 00:44:22,060
I GOT DIBS ON THE DOTS.

874
00:44:22,093 --> 00:44:23,394
* ...GOT PLANS FOR YOU

875
00:44:23,428 --> 00:44:25,731
GOD DAMN!

876
00:44:25,764 --> 00:44:27,899
OOH, HE'S CUTE.

877
00:44:27,933 --> 00:44:30,702
CHECK OUT THE SWEET BUNS
ON THAT GUY.

878
00:44:30,736 --> 00:44:33,739
I'D LIKE TO GET
MY HANDS ON THOSE AND...

879
00:44:33,772 --> 00:44:36,474
[ Deep voice ] WISH
THEY WERE WOMEN'S BREASTS

880
00:44:36,507 --> 00:44:39,510
AND...SQUEEZE THE HELL
OUT OF 'EM.

881
00:44:39,544 --> 00:44:42,313
MAYBE PUT A STEAK
ON 'EM...

882
00:44:42,347 --> 00:44:44,682
'CAUSE I'M A GUY.

883
00:44:44,716 --> 00:44:47,352
THAT'S WHAT GUYS LIKE ME
LIKE TO DO.

884
00:44:47,385 --> 00:44:50,655
BUT I DON'T NEED
TO TELL YOU THAT.

885
00:44:50,688 --> 00:44:53,458
[ INHALES SHARPLY ]

886
00:44:56,227 --> 00:44:58,229
BIANCA.

887
00:44:58,263 --> 00:44:59,597
* YEAH

888
00:44:59,630 --> 00:45:01,332
* OHH

889
00:45:01,366 --> 00:45:02,834
I'LL SHOW HER.

890
00:45:02,868 --> 00:45:04,269
THIS IS MY SONG.

891
00:45:04,302 --> 00:45:05,937
* OHH

892
00:45:05,971 --> 00:45:09,540
REMEMBER,
THE SCORPION ON HER BACK.

893
00:45:09,574 --> 00:45:11,009
I'LL FIND IT.

894
00:45:11,042 --> 00:45:14,279
* 24 A DAY,
7 DAYS A WEEK *

895
00:45:14,312 --> 00:45:16,381
* NOW, WHEN YOU'RE DRIVING
IN YOUR 4x4 *

896
00:45:16,414 --> 00:45:18,917
* AND YOU TURN THIS UP
ON YOUR STEREO *

897
00:45:18,950 --> 00:45:21,386
* WHETHER NIGHT OR DAY,
NONSTOP, YOU'LL PLAY *

898
00:45:21,419 --> 00:45:23,554
* AND YOU KNOW
YOU STILL WANT MORE *

899
00:45:23,588 --> 00:45:26,057
* SO FIND A HONEY
THAT'S STANDING ON THE WALL *

900
00:45:26,091 --> 00:45:28,426
* ALL THE GIRLS
GET THE GUYS ON THE FLOOR *

901
00:45:28,459 --> 00:45:29,928
AH!

902
00:45:30,128 --> 00:45:31,729
* FROM THE FRONT TO THE BACK,
LET'S GO *

903
00:45:31,763 --> 00:45:32,864
* HEAR THIS

904
00:45:32,898 --> 00:45:34,599
EW!

905
00:45:34,632 --> 00:45:36,234
* SOMEBODY HIT THE LIGHTS

906
00:45:36,267 --> 00:45:38,403
* SO WE CAN ROCK IT
DAY AND NIGHT *

907
00:45:38,436 --> 00:45:40,071
April: THE TATTOO!

908
00:45:40,105 --> 00:45:41,572
I DON'T SEE IT!

909
00:45:41,606 --> 00:45:43,074
* FROM A.M. TO P.M.

910
00:45:43,108 --> 00:45:45,243
* EVERYBODY LOOKIN'
LIKE STARS *

911
00:45:45,276 --> 00:45:47,578
* ALL THE CHICKS AND THE FELLAS
IN THE BARS *

912
00:45:47,612 --> 00:45:49,114
* ALL OF Y'ALL BUMPIN' THIS
IN YOUR CARS *

913
00:45:49,147 --> 00:45:50,448
RIGHT HAND, RED.

914
00:45:50,481 --> 00:45:52,083
OOH...LEFT HAND, BLUE.

915
00:45:55,787 --> 00:45:56,521
OOH!

916
00:45:59,324 --> 00:46:00,425
HUH! HA!

917
00:46:02,293 --> 00:46:03,261
AAAAAAH!

918
00:46:03,294 --> 00:46:05,363
* YEAH

919
00:46:09,300 --> 00:46:12,670
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

920
00:46:12,703 --> 00:46:14,739
[ INTRODUCTION TO MYSTIKAL'S
"SHAKE IT FAST" PLAYS ]

921
00:46:14,772 --> 00:46:17,075
[ ALL CHEERING ]

922
00:46:17,108 --> 00:46:19,978
* SHAKE IT FAST,
WATCH YOURSELF *
WHOA!

923
00:46:20,011 --> 00:46:22,613
* SHAKE IT FAST, SHOW ME
WHAT YOU'RE WORKING WITH *
WHOA!

924
00:46:22,647 --> 00:46:24,682
* SHAKE IT FAST,
WATCH YOURSELF *

925
00:46:24,715 --> 00:46:27,318
* SHAKE IT FAST, SHOW ME
WHAT YOU'RE WORKING WITH *

926
00:46:27,352 --> 00:46:29,921
[ ALL CHEERING ]
* SHAKE IT FAST,
WATCH YOURSELF *

927
00:46:29,955 --> 00:46:33,424
AAH!
* SHAKE IT FAST, SHOW ME
WHAT YOU'RE WORKING WITH *

928
00:46:33,458 --> 00:46:35,660
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

929
00:46:35,693 --> 00:46:39,430
[ LAUGHS ]

930
00:46:39,464 --> 00:46:40,966
IT'S DEFINITELY NOT HER.

931
00:46:40,999 --> 00:46:43,268
DON'T WORRY.
WE'LL FIGURE THIS OUT.

932
00:46:43,301 --> 00:46:44,702
YOU'RE A GREAT DANCER.

933
00:46:44,735 --> 00:46:46,872
YOU'RE JUST
NOTICING THAT NOW?

934
00:46:46,905 --> 00:46:48,373
[ LAUGHTER ]

935
00:46:48,406 --> 00:46:50,608
I GOTTA HIT
THE LITTLE GIRLS' ROOM

936
00:46:50,641 --> 00:46:52,177
BEFORE I SOAK MY PANTIES.

937
00:46:52,210 --> 00:46:53,711
[ SLURPING ]

938
00:46:55,146 --> 00:46:57,782
UM...

939
00:46:57,815 --> 00:46:59,484
[ Deep voice ]
BY THAT, I MEAN...

940
00:46:59,517 --> 00:47:02,553
MY GIRLFRIEND'S PANTIES...

941
00:47:02,587 --> 00:47:04,389
WHICH I CARRY WITH ME...

942
00:47:04,589 --> 00:47:06,191
TO PEE IN...

943
00:47:06,224 --> 00:47:07,825
IF I DON'T MAKE IT
IN TIME...

944
00:47:08,026 --> 00:47:09,861
TO THE BATHROOM.

945
00:47:09,895 --> 00:47:11,396
WHAT?

946
00:47:11,429 --> 00:47:13,831
YOU DON'T PEE IN YOUR
GIRLFRIEND'S PANTIES?

947
00:47:13,865 --> 00:47:16,001
WHAT KIND OF GAY CLUB
IS THIS?

948
00:47:16,034 --> 00:47:20,071
HEY, EVERYBODY,
CHECK OUT THIS GUY --

949
00:47:20,105 --> 00:47:24,175
NOT PEEING IN HIS
CHICK'S PANTIES.

950
00:47:36,254 --> 00:47:38,023
[ High-pitched ]
EXCUSE ME...

951
00:47:38,223 --> 00:47:40,691
DO YOU HAVE TO BE
IN HERE FOR THIS?

952
00:47:40,725 --> 00:47:42,693
WELL, IT'S PART OF
MY JOB DESCRIPTION,

953
00:47:42,727 --> 00:47:45,030
BUT IF YOU'RE ONE
OF THOSE SHY GUYS,

954
00:47:45,063 --> 00:47:46,998
YOU TRY THAT STALL THERE.

955
00:47:47,032 --> 00:47:49,935
[ FART ]

956
00:47:49,968 --> 00:47:52,938
UH...THERE'S SOMEONE
IN THERE.

957
00:47:52,971 --> 00:47:55,240
AND THEY'RE GONNA BE IN THERE
FOR A LONG TIME, TOO.

958
00:47:55,273 --> 00:47:57,442
I TOLD HIM TO STAY AWAY
FROM THE CALAMARI.

959
00:47:57,475 --> 00:48:00,245
[ FARTING CONTINUES ]

960
00:48:00,278 --> 00:48:03,648
SOME FOLKS THINK THEY CAN EAT
ANYTHING THAT CRAWLS.

961
00:48:13,424 --> 00:48:14,792
WOULD YOU MIND?

962
00:48:18,329 --> 00:48:21,266
[ SIGHS ]

963
00:48:32,443 --> 00:48:33,611
OOH! AH!

964
00:48:33,644 --> 00:48:35,080
OOH, HOO!

965
00:48:36,114 --> 00:48:39,150
[ GASPING ]

966
00:48:39,184 --> 00:48:42,253
EXCUSE ME?

967
00:48:42,287 --> 00:48:44,255
WHY IS THERE ICE IN THERE?

968
00:48:44,289 --> 00:48:46,591
OOH! I WOULDN'T HAVE
DONE THAT.

969
00:48:46,624 --> 00:48:49,961
[ DOOR HINGES SQUEAK ]

970
00:48:51,096 --> 00:48:52,197
OH!

971
00:48:55,800 --> 00:48:57,502
[ URINATING ]

972
00:49:00,371 --> 00:49:02,940
YOU'RE GOOD AT THAT.

973
00:49:02,974 --> 00:49:05,710
YOU MAKE IT LOOK SO EASY.

974
00:49:15,453 --> 00:49:16,854
WHY DON'T YOU JUST
TAKE A PICTURE?

975
00:49:21,826 --> 00:49:24,162
[ SIGHS ] ALL RIGHT.

976
00:49:24,195 --> 00:49:25,496
HERE GOES.

977
00:49:25,530 --> 00:49:30,301
DISGUSTING! WRINKLY!
GROSS!

978
00:49:30,335 --> 00:49:31,769
EW!

979
00:49:31,802 --> 00:49:33,271
[ URINATING ]
OH!

980
00:49:33,304 --> 00:49:36,607
OH! I'VE NEVER
DONE THIS BEFORE.

981
00:49:36,641 --> 00:49:37,942
IT'S GOING ALL OVER.

982
00:49:37,975 --> 00:49:40,311
IT'S ALWAYS GOOD
TO AIM AT SOMETHING,

983
00:49:40,345 --> 00:49:43,181
LIKE THAT CIGARETTE THERE...
OR THE BIG MINT.

984
00:49:43,214 --> 00:49:44,782
IT'S GOING EVERYWHERE!

985
00:49:44,815 --> 00:49:46,851
YOU GOT TO HOLD ON
TO IT.

986
00:49:46,884 --> 00:49:50,388
OH!
NOT TOO TIGHT, BUT ENOUGH TO
LET IT KNOW YOU'RE THE BOSS.

987
00:49:50,421 --> 00:49:52,890
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

988
00:49:52,923 --> 00:49:53,858
OH!

989
00:49:53,891 --> 00:49:55,726
SEE THAT FLY?

990
00:49:55,760 --> 00:49:57,462
AIM FOR IT.

991
