1236
01:01:10,200 --> 01:01:11,401
[ CHEERING ]

1237
01:01:11,435 --> 01:01:13,037
* I'M A MESS

1238
01:01:15,272 --> 01:01:17,708
* I'M A MESS

1239
01:01:17,742 --> 01:01:18,909
[ INDISTINCT SHOUTING ]

1240
01:01:18,943 --> 01:01:19,944
HEY, BILLY.

1241
01:01:22,279 --> 01:01:23,247
OH!

1242
01:01:23,280 --> 01:01:24,148
YEAH!

1243
01:01:24,181 --> 01:01:25,916
IS HE OKAY?

1244
01:01:25,950 --> 01:01:27,551
WHOO!

1245
01:01:27,752 --> 01:01:30,788
[ WATER RUNNING ]

1246
01:01:32,256 --> 01:01:34,091
Jake:
WHAT'S THE MATTER, MAN?

1247
01:01:34,124 --> 01:01:36,193
YOU AFRAID THE JANITOR'S
GONNA SEE YOUR DINGDONG?

1248
01:01:36,226 --> 01:01:37,627
[ CHUCKLES ]

1249
01:01:41,631 --> 01:01:43,600
SO, WHAT'S UP
WITH YOU AND THE PROM QUEEN?

1250
01:01:43,633 --> 01:01:46,236
I DON'T KNOW.
[ SIGHS ]

1251
01:01:46,436 --> 01:01:49,406
I THOUGHT EVERYTHING WAS FINE,
BUT I GUESS I WAS WRONG.

1252
01:01:49,439 --> 01:01:51,842
SEE, THAT'S WHY
YOU GOTTA HAVE A SPARE, MAN.

1253
01:01:51,876 --> 01:01:54,011
THAT'S WHAT APRIL IS.
SHE'S MY SPARE.

1254
01:01:54,044 --> 01:01:54,879
SPARE?

1255
01:01:55,079 --> 01:01:56,580
YEAH, SHE'S MY BACKUP.

1256
01:01:56,613 --> 01:01:58,682
I MEAN, SHE WAS A FUN RIDE --
NO DOUBT ABOUT THIS --

1257
01:01:58,715 --> 01:02:00,417
BUT SHE IS
A PREVIOUSLY OWNED VEHICLE.

1258
01:02:00,450 --> 01:02:02,219
I'M INTO THAT NEW-CAR SMELL.

1259
01:02:02,419 --> 01:02:04,121
Jessica: YOU ASSHOLE!

1260
01:02:06,723 --> 01:02:09,093
W-WHOEVER LEFT THESE
TOWELS OVER HERE...

1261
01:02:09,126 --> 01:02:10,828
IS AN ASSHOLE.

1262
01:02:15,165 --> 01:02:18,535
NOW, THIS NEW CHICK I GOT --
[ WHISTLES ]

1263
01:02:18,568 --> 01:02:20,637
DUDE, SHE IS GONNA BE
THE HOTTEST CHICK AT THE PROM.

1264
01:02:20,670 --> 01:02:22,572
I BET ONE OF HER
LITTLE HOTTIE FRIENDS

1265
01:02:22,606 --> 01:02:24,141
WOULD LOVE TO GO OUT
WITH THE QUARTERBACK.

1266
01:02:24,174 --> 01:02:26,877
OH, I DON'T KNOW, MAN.
COME ON, MAN.

1267
01:02:26,911 --> 01:02:29,079
MAYBE THIS ONE WILL
PUT OUT, UNLIKE THAT
COLD FISH, JESSICA.

1268
01:02:29,113 --> 01:02:31,648
YOU GO TO HELL!

1269
01:02:34,118 --> 01:02:38,222
WHOEVER LEFT
THESE SHOWERS ON...

1270
01:02:38,255 --> 01:02:40,024
GO TO...HELL.

1271
01:02:41,425 --> 01:02:43,928
HEY...

1272
01:02:43,961 --> 01:02:47,764
JESSICA'S ANYTHING
BUT A COLD FISH, ALL RIGHT?

1273
01:02:49,967 --> 01:02:53,337
SHE'S THE MOST AMAZING GIRL
IN THE WHOLE WORLD.

1274
01:02:53,370 --> 01:02:57,641
DUDE, YOU'VE NEVER EVEN
BEEN OUT OF CALIFORNIA.

1275
01:02:57,674 --> 01:02:59,643
I DON'T CARE.

1276
01:02:59,676 --> 01:03:01,445
I LOVE HER.

1277
01:03:01,478 --> 01:03:03,080
I MEAN, I KNOW SHE THINKS

1278
01:03:03,113 --> 01:03:04,915
I ONLY WANT TO HAVE
SEX WITH HER,

1279
01:03:04,949 --> 01:03:06,917
BUT THAT'S NOT
WHAT IT'S ABOUT.

1280
01:03:06,951 --> 01:03:10,787
I MEAN,
WHEN THAT MOMENT COMES...

1281
01:03:10,821 --> 01:03:13,190
I WANT IT TO BE PERFECT.

1282
01:03:15,860 --> 01:03:17,161
WOW.

1283
01:03:17,194 --> 01:03:19,663
THAT IS THE GAYEST THING
I HAVE EVER HEARD.

1284
01:03:23,633 --> 01:03:26,103
SHE'S THE ONLY GIRL
THAT MAKES MY HEART

1285
01:03:26,136 --> 01:03:28,472
BEAT FASTER AND SLOWER
AT THE SAME TIME.

1286
01:03:31,308 --> 01:03:33,577
WHEN I'M NOT WITH HER...

1287
01:03:33,810 --> 01:03:35,412
I'M NOT LIVING.

1288
01:03:37,681 --> 01:03:42,186
I'M ONLY EXISTING UNTIL I CAN
HOLD HER IN MY ARMS AGAIN.

1289
01:03:42,219 --> 01:03:43,988
[ SIGHS ]

1290
01:03:45,089 --> 01:03:47,557
GAY, GAY, GAY, GAY.

1291
01:03:47,591 --> 01:03:50,127
[ SOBS ]

1292
01:03:50,160 --> 01:03:52,362
[ SNIFFLES, SIGHS ]

1293
01:03:55,432 --> 01:03:59,036
SOMEBODY SHIT IN THE LOCKER.

1294
01:03:59,069 --> 01:04:00,270
[ SNIFFLES ]

1295
01:04:11,381 --> 01:04:13,683
[ SALSA MUSIC PLAYS ]

1296
01:04:15,285 --> 01:04:17,854
CAN I HELP YOU
FIND SOMETHING?

1297
01:04:17,888 --> 01:04:21,325
[ Mexican accent ]
I-I WAS LOOKING FOR MY...

1298
01:04:21,358 --> 01:04:22,526
EARRING.

1299
01:04:22,559 --> 01:04:25,062
IT, UH,
ACCIDENTALLY FELL...

1300
01:04:25,095 --> 01:04:27,164
INTO THE LAWN MOWER...

1301
01:04:27,197 --> 01:04:30,834
AND, UH...RICOCHETED
INTO THE WINDOW.

1302
01:04:30,867 --> 01:04:32,736
[ LAUGHING NERVOUSLY ]

1303
01:04:34,471 --> 01:04:36,873
I'VE ALWAYS LIKED
EARRINGS ON MEN.

1304
01:04:36,907 --> 01:04:38,708
WOULD YOU LIKE SOME LEMONADE?

1305
01:04:41,311 --> 01:04:42,546
HERE YOU GO, TAQUITO.

1306
01:04:42,746 --> 01:04:44,814
IT'S GOT A MEXICAN FLAVOR
TO IT.

1307
01:04:49,219 --> 01:04:52,056
[ COUGHING, CHOKING ]

1308
01:04:53,423 --> 01:04:54,591
[ COUGHING ]

1309
01:04:54,624 --> 01:04:56,093
WHAT THE HELL IS THAT?!

1310
01:04:56,126 --> 01:04:59,263
QUESADILLA AND SPICY MENUDO
WITH JALAPEÑOS --

1311
01:04:59,296 --> 01:05:00,530
YOUR NATIONAL DISH.

1312
01:05:00,564 --> 01:05:03,400
[ LAUGHING ]

1313
01:05:03,433 --> 01:05:05,970
I'M SORRY.

1314
01:05:06,003 --> 01:05:07,704
[ SIGHS, CHUCKLES ]

1315
01:05:07,737 --> 01:05:11,008
[ Deep voice ] IT'S BEEN SO LONG
SINCE I HEARD YOU LAUGH.

1316
01:05:12,809 --> 01:05:14,411
[ Mexican accent ]
I MEAN...

1317
01:05:14,444 --> 01:05:17,014
SINCE I STARTED
WORKING HERE.

1318
01:05:18,282 --> 01:05:19,716
[ MOANING ]
OH! OH!

1319
01:05:19,749 --> 01:05:20,884
[ SMOOCHING ]

1320
01:05:20,917 --> 01:05:21,918
BACK!

1321
01:05:23,420 --> 01:05:24,921
[ GASPS ]

1322
01:05:24,955 --> 01:05:27,424
OH, I -- I AM SO SORRY.

1323
01:05:27,457 --> 01:05:29,426
[ SIGHS ]
NO PROBLEMO.

1324
01:05:29,459 --> 01:05:32,329
[ SIGHS ]

1325
01:05:32,362 --> 01:05:35,165
NO PROBLEMO.

1326
01:05:35,199 --> 01:05:36,300
OH!

1327
01:05:36,333 --> 01:05:38,935
[ Deep voice ]
AAH! CAROL! CAROL! PLEASE!

1328
01:05:38,969 --> 01:05:41,071
THIS WOULD BE
VERY UNNATURAL FOR ME

1329
01:05:41,105 --> 01:05:43,240
IN AT LEAST
FIVE DIFFERENT WAYS!

1330
01:05:43,273 --> 01:05:44,241
AH! OH!

1331
01:05:44,274 --> 01:05:45,309
[ GASPS ]

1332
01:05:46,977 --> 01:05:50,580
SO...YOU LIKE MEN?

1333
01:05:50,614 --> 01:05:52,182
OF COURSE I DO.

1334
01:05:52,216 --> 01:05:54,118
WHAT DO YOU THINK?

1335
01:05:54,151 --> 01:05:56,953
OH...

1336
01:05:58,388 --> 01:05:59,656
OH...

1337
01:05:59,689 --> 01:06:01,658
[ LAUGHS ]

1338
01:06:01,691 --> 01:06:03,293
[ Sighing ] OH...

1339
01:06:05,062 --> 01:06:07,464
[ SIGHS ]

1340
01:06:09,033 --> 01:06:11,401
CAROL...

1341
01:06:16,040 --> 01:06:20,310
YOU ARE A BEAUTIFUL
AND VERY DESIRABLE WOMAN.

1342
01:06:21,745 --> 01:06:25,149
AND YOU HAVE A HUSBAND
WHO'S DYING TO BE WITH YOU.

1343
01:06:25,349 --> 01:06:26,883
H-HE SAID THAT?

1344
01:06:26,916 --> 01:06:28,385
YES.

1345
01:06:29,519 --> 01:06:33,057
I CLEANED UP THE LANGUAGE
A BIT, BUT...YES.

1346
01:06:36,593 --> 01:06:38,195
I KNOW!

1347
01:06:40,430 --> 01:06:43,433
LET'S GO PAINT
YOUR TOENAILS.

1348
01:06:45,035 --> 01:06:47,337
THEN WE'LL WASH YOUR HAIR!

1349
01:06:47,371 --> 01:06:48,872
[ LAUGHS ]

1350
01:06:48,905 --> 01:06:51,007
MY DAUGHTER, JESSIE,
USED TO DO THOSE THINGS FOR ME.

1351
01:06:51,041 --> 01:06:54,811
I'LL MAKE UP FOR THAT
RIGHT NOW.

1352
01:06:54,844 --> 01:06:56,246
COME ON...

1353
01:06:56,280 --> 01:06:59,083
LET'S SHOW THAT MAN OF YOURS
WHAT HE'S BEEN MISSING.

1354
01:06:59,116 --> 01:07:00,450
[ LAUGHS ]
COME ON!

1355
01:07:00,750 --> 01:07:02,619
[ Laughing ] OKAY!

1356
01:07:07,124 --> 01:07:08,024
[ SIGHS ]

1357
01:07:08,058 --> 01:07:09,393
[ CAROL GIGGLING ]

1358
01:07:09,426 --> 01:07:11,061
[ Mexican accent ]
UH-HUH, UH-HUH.

1359
01:07:11,095 --> 01:07:13,897
Sí, YEAH, Sí, Sí.

1360
01:07:13,930 --> 01:07:15,365
UH-HUH. OKAY.

1361
01:07:15,399 --> 01:07:16,900
Sí, UH-HUH, Sí, Sí.

1362
01:07:16,933 --> 01:07:18,602
Sí, Sí.
[ MOANING ]

1363
01:07:18,635 --> 01:07:21,004
TO THE LEFT -- OOH,
RIGHT, RIGHT, RIGHT, RIGHT!

1364
01:07:21,037 --> 01:07:22,839
OH, YES! OH!

1365
01:07:22,872 --> 01:07:24,241
Sí.
I LOVE THAT. OH, YES!

1366
01:07:24,274 --> 01:07:26,610
CAROL!
[ GASPS ]

1367
01:07:26,643 --> 01:07:29,246
HOW COULD YOU?!
IN MY OWN HOUSE?!

1368
01:07:29,279 --> 01:07:30,747
SEÑOR --

1369
01:07:30,780 --> 01:07:33,783
AND YOU, TAQUITO --
WE WERE SUPPOSED TO BE AMIGOS!

1370
01:07:33,817 --> 01:07:36,420
THE LOOFAH FOR
THE SCRUBBING. THE SC--
GET OUT!

1371
01:07:36,453 --> 01:07:38,422
SEÑOR, IS FOR THE --
THE BATH. I WAS --

1372
01:07:38,455 --> 01:07:40,424
SHUT UP-O.
I WAS SCRUBBING.

1373
01:07:40,457 --> 01:07:42,092
OUT!
SEÑOR...

1374
01:07:42,126 --> 01:07:43,627
RICHIE, RICHIE...

1375
01:07:43,827 --> 01:07:46,230
[ SIGHS ] REALLY, I-IT'S --
IT'S NOT WHAT YOU THINK.

1376
01:07:46,263 --> 01:07:47,797
[ SIGHS ]

1377
01:07:47,831 --> 01:07:49,499
IT'S MY OWN FAULT.

1378
01:07:55,004 --> 01:07:57,541
OH, DADDY!

1379
01:07:57,574 --> 01:07:58,742
MMM! OH!

1380
01:07:58,775 --> 01:08:01,611
[ WATER SPLASHES ]
OH! OH, DADDY!

1381
01:08:06,616 --> 01:08:08,585
LOOK AT
ALL THESE EARRINGS.

1382
01:08:08,618 --> 01:08:09,919
IT'S HOPELESS.

1383
01:08:09,953 --> 01:08:10,920
I'M SORRY.

1384
01:08:10,954 --> 01:08:12,556
[ SIGHS ]

1385
01:08:12,589 --> 01:08:14,391
THE PROM'S IN THREE DAYS.

1386
01:08:14,424 --> 01:08:16,960
FORGET ABOUT
THE CHEER COMPETITION.

1387
01:08:20,130 --> 01:08:21,598
[ SIGHS DEEPLY ]

1388
01:08:21,631 --> 01:08:23,167
I HAD IT ALL.

1389
01:08:25,034 --> 01:08:27,771
AND I NEVER REALLY
APPRECIATED IT.

1390
01:08:27,804 --> 01:08:30,307
I TOOK EVERYBODY
FOR GRANTED.

1391
01:08:31,608 --> 01:08:35,612
OH, AND TODAY, MY DAD WALKED IN
ON ME AND MY MOM IN THE TUB.

1392
01:08:36,713 --> 01:08:40,116
I THINK I MAY HAVE
LOST MY JOB AS GARDENER.

1393
01:08:40,150 --> 01:08:41,418
[ SIGHS ]

1394
01:08:41,451 --> 01:08:44,254
YOU KNOW, I'M KINDA
SORRY TO SAY THIS,

1395
01:08:44,288 --> 01:08:47,424
BUT...THIS HAS BEEN
REALLY FUN.

1396
01:08:47,457 --> 01:08:48,925
[ GIGGLING ]

1397
01:08:48,958 --> 01:08:50,427
[ LAUGHING ]

1398
01:08:50,460 --> 01:08:51,895
YEAH, RIGHT.

1399
01:08:52,128 --> 01:08:53,930
[ TELEPHONE RINGS,
ANSWERING MACHINE BEEPS ]

1400
01:08:53,963 --> 01:08:56,166
Jake: Hey, babe, it's Jake.

1401
01:08:56,200 --> 01:08:58,202
Listen, I got a half-hour
after wrestling.

1402
01:08:58,235 --> 01:09:01,671
I CAN EITHER TAKE A SHOWER
OR I CAN COME ON OVER.

1403
01:09:07,977 --> 01:09:09,946
[ Deep voice ]
TOO LATE, DUDE.

1404
01:09:09,979 --> 01:09:11,881
She's with me right now.

1405
01:09:11,915 --> 01:09:14,918
SHE SAYS THAT MY PEEPEE'S
WAY BIGGER THAN YOURS.

1406
01:09:16,520 --> 01:09:18,722
AND THAT'S
IF I FOLD IT IN HALF.

1407
01:09:18,755 --> 01:09:19,889
[ GASPS ]

1408
01:09:19,923 --> 01:09:21,325
WHA--

1409
01:09:22,426 --> 01:09:24,461
NO WAY!
[ LAUGHS ]

1410
01:09:24,494 --> 01:09:27,331
OH, MY GOD,
THAT WAS AWESOME, SPENCE.

1411
01:09:27,364 --> 01:09:28,565
[ High-pitched ] ANYTIME.

1412
01:09:28,598 --> 01:09:30,600
[ LAUGHS ]

1413
01:09:30,834 --> 01:09:32,068
[ BOTH SIGH ]

1414
01:09:32,101 --> 01:09:33,803
[ SIGHS ]

1415
01:09:33,837 --> 01:09:37,574
YOU KNOW, I REALLY THOUGHT
I WAS IN LOVE.

1416
01:09:39,343 --> 01:09:41,511
HOW DO YOU KNOW FOR SURE,
ANYWAY?

1417
01:09:42,779 --> 01:09:45,382
I THINK IT'S WHEN
YOU FIND SOMEONE

1418
01:09:45,415 --> 01:09:48,418
THAT YOU CAN REALLY
BE YOURSELF WITH...

1419
01:09:48,452 --> 01:09:51,187
SHARE ANYTHING...
YOU KNOW?

1420
01:09:51,221 --> 01:09:53,323
YOU MEAN LIKE BEST FRIENDS?

1421
01:09:53,357 --> 01:09:54,524
YEAH.

1422
01:09:57,093 --> 01:09:59,696
LOVE'S WHEN
YOU CAN'T EVEN IMAGINE

1423
01:09:59,729 --> 01:10:02,932
WHAT YOUR LIFE WOULD BE LIKE
WITHOUT THAT OTHER PERSON,

1424
01:10:02,966 --> 01:10:07,203
WHEN WORDS DON'T COME CLOSE TO
HOW YOUR HEART REALLY FEELS.

1425
01:10:07,237 --> 01:10:10,607
AND EVEN THOUGH IT DOESN'T
MAKE SENSE TO OTHER PEOPLE,

1426
01:10:10,640 --> 01:10:12,842
YOU KNOW YOU'RE MEANT
TO BE TOGETHER.

1427
01:10:12,876 --> 01:10:13,910
YEAH.

1428
01:10:13,943 --> 01:10:16,413
AND YOU SPEND ALL NIGHT
THINKING ABOUT HIM.

1429
01:10:16,446 --> 01:10:19,416
AND IN THE MORNING,
YOU'VE NEVER FELT MORE RESTED.

1430
01:10:19,449 --> 01:10:21,618
OH, IT'S LIKE YOU HAVE TO
GRAB ON TO SOMETHING,

1431
01:10:21,651 --> 01:10:24,254
'CAUSE IT SEEMS LIKE YOUR WHOLE
BODY'S ABOUT TO FLOAT AWAY.

1432
01:10:24,288 --> 01:10:25,455
[ GASPS EXCITEDLY ]

1433
01:10:25,489 --> 01:10:26,923
[ EXHALES DEEPLY ]

1434
01:10:26,956 --> 01:10:28,392
OKAY...

1435
01:10:28,425 --> 01:10:30,260
[ EXHALES SHARPLY ]
WHAT?

1436
01:10:30,294 --> 01:10:31,428
I HAVE AN IDEA.

1437
01:10:31,461 --> 01:10:32,929
WHAT? WHAT, WHAT?

1438
01:10:32,962 --> 01:10:34,898
TELL --
IT MIGHT SOUND
KIND OF CRAZY.

1439
01:10:34,931 --> 01:10:36,600
TELL ME. TELL ME.
WHAT?

1440
01:10:36,633 --> 01:10:40,437
WHY DON'T YOU AND I
GO TO THE PROM TOGETHER?

1441
01:10:42,606 --> 01:10:44,240
THAT WOULD BE AWESOME!

1442
01:10:44,274 --> 01:10:46,209
YEAH!
[ LAUGHS ] YEAH!

1443
01:10:46,242 --> 01:10:48,211
SO COOL!
[ BOTH LAUGHING ]

1444
01:10:48,244 --> 01:10:49,178
AAAH!

1445
01:10:49,413 --> 01:10:50,447
YEAH!

1446
01:10:50,480 --> 01:10:52,482
WE'D MAKE JAKE SO JEALOUS.

1447
01:10:52,682 --> 01:10:55,285
YEAH.

1448
01:10:55,319 --> 01:10:56,653
AHHHH.

1449
01:10:56,686 --> 01:10:57,787
[ LAUGHS ]

1450
01:10:57,821 --> 01:10:59,623
I GOT TO PEE.
OOH, I GOT TO PEE.

1451
01:10:59,656 --> 01:11:00,924
OOH.

1452
01:11:00,957 --> 01:11:02,125
[ EXHALES SHARPLY ]

1453
01:11:02,158 --> 01:11:04,127
HMM-HOO!

1454
01:11:04,160 --> 01:11:06,763
[ URINATING ]

1455
01:11:06,796 --> 01:11:08,598
[ FARTING ]
OH.

1456
01:11:08,632 --> 01:11:10,300
[ EXHALES SHARPLY ]

1457
01:11:10,334 --> 01:11:12,802
[ URINATING, FARTING ]
OH!

1458
01:11:12,836 --> 01:11:14,771
OH, JEEZ!
[ SPLATTERING ]

1459
01:11:14,971 --> 01:11:16,172
SORRY, I'LL GET THAT.

1460
01:11:16,205 --> 01:11:17,407
ARE YOU OKAY?

1461
01:11:17,441 --> 01:11:18,642
I'LL GET IT.

1462
01:11:18,675 --> 01:11:20,944
SORRY.

1463
01:11:20,977 --> 01:11:24,180
* ASH TO ASH

1464
01:11:24,213 --> 01:11:28,017
* AND DUST TO DUST

1465
01:11:28,051 --> 01:11:30,354
* WE DREAM OF...

1466
01:11:30,387 --> 01:11:31,621
JESSICA?

1467
01:11:31,655 --> 01:11:33,256
* WE SOLD YOU...

1468
01:11:33,289 --> 01:11:34,624
JESSICA?!

1469
01:11:34,658 --> 01:11:36,125
* OUR TRUST

1470
01:11:36,159 --> 01:11:39,463
[ TIRES SQUEALING ]

1471
01:11:39,663 --> 01:11:41,197
JESSICA!

1472
01:11:41,230 --> 01:11:43,032
OH, JESSICA.

1473
01:11:43,066 --> 01:11:45,935
OH. OH, THANK GOD.
[ CHUCKLES ]

1474
01:11:45,969 --> 01:11:48,004
[ SIGHS ]
I LOVE YOU, BABY.

1475
01:11:48,037 --> 01:11:49,105
[ SIGHS DEEPLY ]

1476
01:11:49,138 --> 01:11:51,007
I WOULD DO
ANYTHING FOR YOU.

1477
01:11:51,040 --> 01:11:52,442
[ SCOFFS ] YEAH?

1478
01:11:52,476 --> 01:11:55,111
[ SIGHS DEEPLY ]

1479
01:11:55,144 --> 01:11:57,614
UH...
HOW MUCH MONEY YOU GOT?

1480
01:11:57,647 --> 01:11:58,882
WHAT?

1481
01:11:58,915 --> 01:12:00,216
HOW MUCH MONEY YOU GOT?

1482
01:12:00,249 --> 01:12:01,885
UM...

1483
01:12:01,918 --> 01:12:03,553
UH...

1484
01:12:03,587 --> 01:12:04,721
ABOUT $40.

1485
01:12:06,590 --> 01:12:08,091
THAT YOUR CAR?

1486
01:12:10,560 --> 01:12:12,161
IT'S MY DAD'S.

1487
01:12:12,195 --> 01:12:13,830
YOU KNOW THAT.

1488
01:12:13,863 --> 01:12:16,400
OH, YEAH. COOL.

1489
01:12:16,433 --> 01:12:18,001
GIVE ME THE KEYS.

1490
01:12:20,203 --> 01:12:21,471
[ KEYS JINGLING ]

1491
01:12:21,505 --> 01:12:22,739
OH. THANKS.

1492
01:12:22,772 --> 01:12:24,207
[ SNIFFS ]

1493
01:12:24,240 --> 01:12:27,377
HEY, UH, SO, UH,
W-WHAT'D YOU SAY YOUR NAME WAS?

1494
01:12:28,412 --> 01:12:29,513
BILLY.

1495
01:12:29,546 --> 01:12:31,415
OH, YEAH. OOH.

1496
01:12:33,950 --> 01:12:36,285
TAKE IT EASY, BOBBY.

1497
01:12:37,454 --> 01:12:39,155
[ DOOR CREAKS, CLOSES ]
IT'S "BILLY."

1498
01:12:39,188 --> 01:12:40,690
[ ENGINE TURNS OVER ]

1499
01:12:40,724 --> 01:12:42,526
[ TIRES SQUEALING ]

1500
01:12:44,594 --> 01:12:48,231
[ TIRES SQUEALING ]

1501
01:12:48,264 --> 01:12:49,566
[ CHUCKLES ]

1502
01:12:49,599 --> 01:12:51,300
[ ROCK MUSIC PLAYS,
TIRES SQUEALING ]

1503
01:12:53,870 --> 01:12:55,104
AAAH!

1504
01:12:57,441 --> 01:12:59,008
[ MUSIC STOPS ]

1505
01:12:59,042 --> 01:13:00,877
[ PANTING ]

1506
01:13:03,780 --> 01:13:05,882
[ CRYING SOFTLY ]

1507
01:13:05,915 --> 01:13:07,784
[ CROWD CHEERING,
DANCE MUSIC PLAYS ]

1508
01:13:14,257 --> 01:13:15,559
YEAH.

1509
01:13:19,963 --> 01:13:21,731
[ WHISTLE BLOWS, MUSIC STOPS ]

1510
01:13:21,765 --> 01:13:24,768
[ SALSA MUSIC PLAYS ]

1511
01:13:29,338 --> 01:13:30,674
WHERE'S JESSICA?

1512
01:13:30,907 --> 01:13:33,943
[ SIGHS ]
DON'T WORRY, MISS BERNARD.

1513
01:13:33,977 --> 01:13:35,278
SHE'LL BE HERE.

1514
01:13:35,311 --> 01:13:37,080
[ MUSIC CONTINUES ]

1515
01:13:37,113 --> 01:13:39,483
[ MEN SINGING IN SPANISH ]

1516
01:13:46,022 --> 01:13:48,024
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

1517
01:13:50,259 --> 01:13:51,895
HEY.

1518
01:13:51,928 --> 01:13:54,764
[ EXHALES SHARPLY ] I REALLY
HOPE THIS WORKS, JESSICA.

1519
01:13:54,798 --> 01:13:57,233
COME ON,
LET'S GO KICK SOME ASS.

1520
01:13:57,266 --> 01:13:59,002
OKAY.

1521
01:13:59,035 --> 01:14:00,570
AAH. OH!

1522
01:14:00,604 --> 01:14:02,772
DUDE, THERE'S JESSICA.

1523
01:14:02,806 --> 01:14:04,273
WHATEVER.

1524
01:14:04,307 --> 01:14:06,075
DUDE!

1525
01:14:06,109 --> 01:14:08,144
[ WHISTLES, CHEERS ]

1526
01:14:08,177 --> 01:14:09,479
NUMBER ONE!

1527
01:14:23,560 --> 01:14:25,762
SHE DOES LOVE ME.

1528
01:14:25,795 --> 01:14:27,531
[ DANCE MUSIC PLAYS,
WHIP CRACKS ]

1529
01:14:27,564 --> 01:14:30,199
* ARE YOU FEELING FIERCE?

1530
01:14:35,471 --> 01:14:37,541
[ INTRODUCTION TO RUN-D.M.C.'s
"IT'S TRICKY" PLAYS ]

1531
01:14:37,574 --> 01:14:39,342
* IT'S TRICKY
TO ROCK A RHYME *

1532
01:14:39,543 --> 01:14:41,044
* TO ROCK A RHYME
THAT'S RIGHT ON TIME *

1533
01:14:41,077 --> 01:14:42,712
* IT'S TRICKY

1534
01:14:42,746 --> 01:14:45,214
* IT'S TRICKY, TRICKY,
TRICKY, TRICKY *

1535
01:14:45,248 --> 01:14:47,250
[ DANCE MUSIC PLAYS ]

1536
01:14:52,355 --> 01:14:54,023
WHOO-HOO!

1537
01:14:54,057 --> 01:14:56,893
[ HIP-HOP MUSIC PLAYS ]

1538
01:15:03,533 --> 01:15:05,735
All: THE BEES ARE COMING!
THE BEES ARE COMING!

1539
01:15:05,769 --> 01:15:06,970
STING THIS!

1540
01:15:07,003 --> 01:15:08,805
THAT'S YOU! THAT'S YOU!
I SEE YOU!

1541
01:15:08,838 --> 01:15:10,807
[ HIP-HOP MUSIC PLAYS ]

1542
01:15:10,840 --> 01:15:12,175
YEAH!

1543
01:15:13,509 --> 01:15:14,744
[ MUSIC STOPS ]

1544
01:15:14,778 --> 01:15:17,446
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

1545
01:15:18,748 --> 01:15:20,550
WHOA! OH!
Girl: AAAH!

1546
01:15:20,750 --> 01:15:22,218
[ ALL GASPING ]

1547
01:15:22,251 --> 01:15:23,319
AAAH!

1548
01:15:23,352 --> 01:15:25,221
[ PANTING ]

1549
01:15:25,254 --> 01:15:26,956
[ GIRLS SCREAMING ]

1550
01:15:28,558 --> 01:15:29,893
[ VOMITING ]
OH! JE--

1551
01:15:30,093 --> 01:15:31,227
[ RETCHING ]

1552
01:15:31,260 --> 01:15:32,896
OH, COME ON, MAN.

1553
01:15:41,871 --> 01:15:43,072
[ FEEDBACK ]

1554
01:15:43,272 --> 01:15:44,774
LADIES AND GENTLEMEN,

1555
01:15:44,808 --> 01:15:47,510
IT APPEARS THE OLDER GENTLEMAN
IN THE BEE OUTFIT

1556
01:15:47,543 --> 01:15:50,513
WITH THE FAKE BOOBS
IS THE SCHOOL JANITOR.

1557
01:15:50,546 --> 01:15:54,417
AS PER SECTION 31C
OF THE RULE BOOK,

1558
01:15:54,450 --> 01:15:57,587
SCHOOL EMPLOYEES
ARE ALLOWED TO BE MASCOTS.

1559
01:15:57,621 --> 01:16:00,123
SAY HELLO
TO YOUR NEW CHAMPIONS --

1560
01:16:00,156 --> 01:16:02,225
THE BRIDGETOWN HONEYS!

1561
01:16:02,258 --> 01:16:04,160
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]
AAAH!AAAH!AAAH!

1562
01:16:06,562 --> 01:16:08,064
AAAH!

1563
01:16:08,097 --> 01:16:08,932
YEAH!

1564
01:16:08,965 --> 01:16:10,366
YEAH!

1565
01:16:10,399 --> 01:16:12,568
AAAH!AAAH!
AAAH!AAAH!

1566
01:16:12,602 --> 01:16:14,904
[ LAUGHING WILDLY ]

1567
01:16:17,273 --> 01:16:18,942
WHOO-HOO!
OH!

1568
01:16:20,443 --> 01:16:21,911
UGH!

1569
01:16:21,945 --> 01:16:23,947
* GIVE ME ALL YOUR FEAR

1570
01:16:23,980 --> 01:16:27,316
* THROW IT ALL AWAY

1571
01:16:27,350 --> 01:16:30,586
* AND THINK
ABOUT THE GOOD THINGS *

1572
01:16:30,620 --> 01:16:33,589
* NO MATTER WHAT THEY SAY

1573
01:16:33,623 --> 01:16:39,896
* WE'LL TAKE TOMORROW,
BABY, YEAH *

1574
01:16:39,929 --> 01:16:43,266
* ONE DAY AT A TIME

1575
01:16:43,299 --> 01:16:45,601
Woman on TV: HERE'S
A BIZARRE STORY FOR YOU --

1576
01:16:45,635 --> 01:16:47,603
POLICE ARE NOW SEARCHING
FOR THE HOT CHICK BANDIT --

1577
01:16:47,637 --> 01:16:51,407
A BEAUTIFUL YOUNG WOMAN WHO
LURES MEN INTO DARK ALLEYWAYS,

1578
01:16:51,440 --> 01:16:54,443
BEATS THEM SENSELESS,
AND TAKES THEIR WALLETS.

1579
01:16:54,477 --> 01:16:56,612
WELL, WE THOUGHT
MAYBE SHE NEEDED SOME HELP.

1580
01:16:56,646 --> 01:16:58,581
YEAH, WE'RE HELPFUL GUYS.

1581
01:16:58,614 --> 01:17:00,950
SO WE WENT INTO THE ALLEY, AND
THEN SHE STARTS WAILING ON ME.

1582
01:17:00,984 --> 01:17:03,419
AND LET ME TELL YOU --
SHE DIDN'T HIT LIKE A GIRL.

1583
01:17:03,452 --> 01:17:06,089
LUCKILY, FITZY,
THE GOOD GUY THAT HE IS --

1584
01:17:06,122 --> 01:17:09,192
HE WAS HIDING BEHIND A DUMPSTER
WITH A VIDEO CAMERA.

1585
01:17:09,225 --> 01:17:11,227
LOOKS LIKE SHE WORKED YOU OVER
PRETTY GOOD.

1586
01:17:11,460 --> 01:17:13,496
YEAH, WELL,
DON'T GET ME WRONG --

1587
01:17:13,529 --> 01:17:15,932
I GOT SOME SHOTS IN.

1588
01:17:15,965 --> 01:17:17,166
OW!

1589
01:17:17,366 --> 01:17:18,702
[ THUD, THUD, THUD ]
OW! OW! OW!

1590
01:17:18,735 --> 01:17:19,936
[ WHIMPERING ]

1591
01:17:19,969 --> 01:17:21,905
OW!

1592
01:17:22,138 --> 01:17:23,272
OW!

1593
01:17:23,306 --> 01:17:24,440
[ THUD ]
OWWW!

1594
01:17:24,473 --> 01:17:25,474
[ THUD ]

1595
01:17:25,508 --> 01:17:26,710
OWWW!

1596
01:17:26,743 --> 01:17:28,812
WHY? OH, GOD.

1597
01:17:28,845 --> 01:17:31,180
OH, GOD, THAT HURT.

1598
01:17:31,214 --> 01:17:32,716
OWWW!

1599
01:17:32,749 --> 01:17:35,819
[ WHIMPERING ]

1600
01:17:35,852 --> 01:17:38,154
WHY?! [ WHIMPERING ]
[ TELEPHONE BEEPING ]

1601
01:17:38,354 --> 01:17:40,056
[ WHIMPERING CONTINUES ]

1602
01:17:40,089 --> 01:17:41,324
[ RINGING ]

1603
01:17:41,357 --> 01:17:43,359
HI, IT'S APRIL.
LEAVE ME A MESSAGE.

1604
01:17:43,392 --> 01:17:45,394
[ BEEP ]
April, it's Hildenburg.

1605
01:17:45,428 --> 01:17:48,164
I think I found Jessica's body.
It's in an alley outside a bar.

1606
01:17:48,197 --> 01:17:50,399
But we got to move fast,
because the police are
already looking for it.

1607
01:17:50,433 --> 01:17:51,801
CALL ME BACK.
OHH! OH!

1608
01:17:51,835 --> 01:17:53,202
AAAAHHH!

1609
01:17:53,236 --> 01:17:54,771
[ THUD ]
[ CAT SCREECHES ]

1610
01:18:01,244 --> 01:18:03,947
[ SLOW PIANO MUSIC PLAYS ]

1611
01:18:11,520 --> 01:18:13,790
[ JESSICA SNIFFLES,
CRIES SOFTLY ]

1612
01:18:25,068 --> 01:18:26,335
JESSICA?

1613
01:18:26,369 --> 01:18:28,738
[ CRYING SOFTLY ]

1614
01:18:28,772 --> 01:18:31,574
[ SIGHS DEEPLY ]

1615
01:18:31,607 --> 01:18:33,176
[ SNIFFLES ]

1616
01:18:33,209 --> 01:18:36,379
[ SNIFFLES ]
NOT NOW, BOOGER.

1617
01:18:36,412 --> 01:18:38,047
I KNEW IT!

1618
01:18:38,081 --> 01:18:40,049
JESSIE, IT IS YOU!

1619
01:18:43,619 --> 01:18:45,721
HOW COME YOU DIDN'T
SNITCH ON ME?

1620
01:18:45,755 --> 01:18:47,256
'CAUSE YOU'RE MY SISTER,

1621
01:18:47,290 --> 01:18:49,558
AND I ACCEPT YOU
FOR WHO YOU ARE.

1622
01:18:51,394 --> 01:18:53,997
COME HERE.
[ SIGHS DEEPLY ]

1623
01:18:55,999 --> 01:18:57,266
[ INHALES SHARPLY ]

1624
01:18:57,300 --> 01:18:59,235
YOU ARE SUCH
A LITTLE WEIRDO.

1625
01:18:59,435 --> 01:19:00,937
[ SNIFFLES ]

1626
01:19:12,949 --> 01:19:16,152
* THAT'S RIGHT, DON'T BE
LOOKING AT ME LIKE THAT *

1627
01:19:16,185 --> 01:19:18,487
* SEE, MY NAME
IS GRANDMA FUNK, Y'ALL *

1628
01:19:18,521 --> 01:19:21,257
* FUNK IF YOU'RE NASTY,
DARLING *

1629
01:19:21,290 --> 01:19:22,558
OOH...

1630
01:19:22,591 --> 01:19:25,161
SWEET AS CAND-Y!

1631
01:19:25,194 --> 01:19:26,762
Keecia's mother:
LING-LING!

1632
01:19:26,796 --> 01:19:28,564
* I NEED
A LITTLE MORE VOLUME *

1633
01:19:28,597 --> 01:19:32,101
"L" TO THE "I"
TO THE "N" TO THE "G."

1634
01:19:32,135 --> 01:19:33,402
[ LAUGHS ]

1635
01:19:33,436 --> 01:19:36,405
LING-LING, YOU FORGOT
YOUR BLING-BLING.

1636
01:19:36,439 --> 01:19:39,809
MOM...
YOU'RE RUINING MY LIFE!

1637
01:19:41,177 --> 01:19:43,412
I JUST WANT
TO MEET YOU HALFWAY.

1638
01:19:43,446 --> 01:19:44,981
* ARE YOU READY TO GET DOWN,
GET FUNKY? *

1639
01:19:45,014 --> 01:19:47,150
NIGGA, "PREASE"!

1640
01:19:47,183 --> 01:19:50,019
[ GROOVE ARMADA'S
"I SEE YOU, BABY" PLAYS ]

1641
01:19:57,026 --> 01:19:59,829
I WISH MY MAMA GOT ME
SOME BLING-BLING.

1642
01:19:59,863 --> 01:20:01,931
HONEY, IF YOU DON'T
WANT HER AS YOUR MAMA,

1643
01:20:01,965 --> 01:20:03,166
I'LL TAKE HER.

1644
01:20:03,199 --> 01:20:05,001
GIRL, PLEASE.
GIRL, PLEASE.

1645
01:20:05,034 --> 01:20:06,435
* UH!

1646
01:20:06,469 --> 01:20:07,937
* WHAT?
* UH!

1647
01:20:07,971 --> 01:20:09,939
* COME ON!
* UH!

1648
01:20:09,973 --> 01:20:12,808
[ EERIE MUSIC PLAYS,
SIREN WAILING ]

1649
01:20:25,188 --> 01:20:27,823
* WHOA,
HEY, HEY, HEY, HEY, HEY *

1650
01:20:27,857 --> 01:20:30,359
* WHOA,
PRETTY, PRETTY SHY ONE *

1651
01:20:30,393 --> 01:20:33,029
* WHOA,
HEY, HEY, HEY, HEY, HEY *

1652
01:20:33,062 --> 01:20:34,998
* WHOA,
PRETTY, PRETTY FLY ONE *

1653
01:20:35,031 --> 01:20:36,399
YOU STILL THINK I HAVE
A CHANCE AT PROM QUEEN?

1654
01:20:36,599 --> 01:20:37,901
NO.

1655
01:20:37,934 --> 01:20:39,468
OKAY.

1656
01:20:39,502 --> 01:20:42,605
[ MUSIC CONTINUES ]

1657
01:20:44,273 --> 01:20:45,274
MOM!

1658
01:20:46,842 --> 01:20:48,511
I'M SORRY.

1659
01:20:48,544 --> 01:20:50,813
BUT WHY DO YOU HAVE TO
KEEP EMBARRASSING ME

1660
01:20:50,846 --> 01:20:52,015
IN FRONT OF MY FRIENDS?

1661
01:20:52,048 --> 01:20:54,317
[ SIGHS ]

1662
01:20:54,350 --> 01:20:56,619
YOU'RE NOT ASHAMED OF ME.

1663
01:20:58,287 --> 01:21:01,224
YOU'RE REALLY ASHAMED
OF YOURSELF.

1664
01:21:01,257 --> 01:21:03,426
[ BREATHING SHAKILY ]

1665
01:21:03,459 --> 01:21:04,727
TELL LULU --

1666
01:21:04,760 --> 01:21:07,030
EASY ON THE CHRONIC.

1667
01:21:07,063 --> 01:21:08,864
[ ENGINE TURNS OVER,
BUZZING ]

1668
01:21:08,898 --> 01:21:10,934
* BOW DOWN
* WHEN I COME TO YOUR TOWN

1669
01:21:10,967 --> 01:21:13,169
* BOW DOWN
* WHEN I'M WESTWARD BOUND

1670
01:21:13,202 --> 01:21:14,537
* BOW DOWN

1671
01:21:14,570 --> 01:21:16,705
* 'CAUSE I AIN'T
A HATER LIKE YOU *

1672
01:21:16,739 --> 01:21:18,674
* BOW DOWN TO A DEALER
THAT'S GREATER THAN YOU *

1673
01:21:18,707 --> 01:21:21,744
* I TAKE TEN STEPS,
AND I DRAW *

1674
01:21:21,777 --> 01:21:22,912
[ TELEPHONE RINGING ]

1675
01:21:22,946 --> 01:21:25,181
OHHH! OH! OH!

1676
01:21:25,214 --> 01:21:27,583
[ RINGING CONTINUES ]

1677
01:21:27,616 --> 01:21:29,752
[ BEEP ]

1678
01:21:29,785 --> 01:21:32,488
OH, H-H-HI, CAROL.

1679
01:21:34,657 --> 01:21:36,725
JESSICA
DIDN'T GET READY HERE.

1680
01:21:38,627 --> 01:21:42,265
NO. NO, SHE HASN'T
BEEN HERE ALL WEEK.

1681
01:21:44,100 --> 01:21:45,801
[ BEEP ]

1682
01:21:45,834 --> 01:21:47,903
OH! I KNEW IT!

1683
01:21:47,937 --> 01:21:50,373
[ GASPS ] SOMETHING IS GOING ON
WITH JESSICA AND APRIL.

1684
01:21:50,406 --> 01:21:53,109
OH...OH, I'M GONNA
GET TO THE BOTTOM OF IT.

1685
01:21:53,142 --> 01:21:56,745
IF YOU RUIN APRIL'S NIGHT,
I WILL HAVE YOU PUT AWAY.

1686
01:21:56,779 --> 01:21:58,247
WH--

1687
01:21:58,447 --> 01:22:01,217
I-IF YOU'RE NOT GONNA HELP ME,
I-I'M GONNA DO IT MYSELF.

1688
01:22:01,250 --> 01:22:02,785
[ RUSTLING ]

1689
01:22:06,855 --> 01:22:09,625
[ TIRES SQUEALING ]

1690
01:22:11,460 --> 01:22:13,696
[ HORN BLARING ]

1691
01:22:16,632 --> 01:22:19,435
[ BLARING CONTINUES ]

1692
01:22:19,468 --> 01:22:21,437
[ MICHELLE BRANCH'S
"YOU GET ME" PLAYS ]

1693
01:22:21,470 --> 01:22:23,906
* SO I'M A LITTLE LEFT
OF CENTER *

1694
01:22:23,939 --> 01:22:25,674
* I'M A LITTLE OUT OF TUNE

1695
01:22:25,708 --> 01:22:27,076
I THINK THIS
IS A GOOD SPOT.

1696
01:22:27,110 --> 01:22:28,644
* SOME SAY I'M PARANORMAL

1697
01:22:28,677 --> 01:22:30,246
JAKE'S GOT TO
COME RIGHT BY HERE.

1698
01:22:30,279 --> 01:22:32,681
I DON'T REALLY CARE
ABOUT JAKE ANYMORE.

1699
01:22:32,715 --> 01:22:35,518
YOU SHOULDN'T.
HE'S A JERK.

1700
01:22:35,551 --> 01:22:37,753
THERE'S NO ONE I'D RATHER
BE WITH HERE TONIGHT.

1701
01:22:37,786 --> 01:22:39,422
* I DON'T CARE
WHAT THEY'RE SAYING *

1702
01:22:39,455 --> 01:22:40,589
ME EITHER.

1703
01:22:40,623 --> 01:22:41,924
[ EXHALES SHARPLY ]

1704
01:22:41,957 --> 01:22:43,426
* AS LONG AS I'M YOUR GIRL

1705
01:22:43,459 --> 01:22:46,929
APRIL, YOU LOOK
SO BEAUTIFUL TONIGHT.

1706
01:22:46,962 --> 01:22:49,432
NO ONE HAS EVER BEEN THERE
FOR ME LIKE YOU HAVE.

1707
01:22:49,465 --> 01:22:51,400
YOU'VE ALWAYS
BEEN THERE FOR ME.

1708
01:22:51,634 --> 01:22:55,471
ANY GUY WOULD BE SO LUCKY TO
HAVE YOU AS THEIR GIRLFRIEND.

1709
01:22:55,504 --> 01:22:57,840
AND I SHOULD KNOW.

1710
01:22:57,873 --> 01:23:00,043
I'VE BEEN A GUY
FOR ALMOST A WEEK NOW.

1711
01:23:00,243 --> 01:23:03,646
AND IN THAT TIME, YOU HAVE BEEN
SUCH A GOOD FRIEND TO ME.

1712
01:23:03,679 --> 01:23:06,349
I DON'T KNOW HOW
I COULD EVER THANK YOU.

1713
01:23:06,382 --> 01:23:09,185
EHHHH...

1714
01:23:12,088 --> 01:23:13,289
HERE HE COMES.

1715
01:23:13,322 --> 01:23:15,491
[ BOTH CHUCKLE ]

1716
01:23:17,726 --> 01:23:19,962
THAT DRESS LOOKS GREAT.

1717
01:23:19,995 --> 01:23:22,531
IS IT EASY TO GET OUT OF?

1718
01:23:22,565 --> 01:23:23,599
[ SLURPS ]

1719
01:23:28,437 --> 01:23:31,006
[ INHALES DEEPLY ]

1720
01:23:33,176 --> 01:23:33,809
GOD.

1721
01:23:33,842 --> 01:23:35,244
AAAH!

1722
01:23:35,278 --> 01:23:37,380
OH...

1723
01:23:41,450 --> 01:23:44,253
I AM SO LESBIAN
RIGHT NOW.

1724
01:23:46,122 --> 01:23:47,890
[ SCOFFS ]

1725
01:23:47,923 --> 01:23:50,659
WE TOTALLY NAILED HIM.
[ LAUGHS ]

1726
01:23:50,693 --> 01:23:52,695
JAKE IS SO JEALOUS.

1727
01:23:52,728 --> 01:23:55,030
HE SPILLED HIS DRINK
ALL OVER HIS DATE.

1728
01:23:55,064 --> 01:23:57,466
YOU SHOULD'VE SEEN IT.
[ LAUGHS ]

1729
01:24:01,270 --> 01:24:04,307
WE ALREADY GOT HIM, HONEY.
HE CAN'T SEE US ANYM--

1730
01:24:09,612 --> 01:24:11,247
SPENCE, I LOVE YOU.

1731
01:24:11,280 --> 01:24:13,916
I LOVE YOU, TOO, APRIL.

1732
01:24:13,949 --> 01:24:17,186
IF YOU WEREN'T HOLDING ON
TO ME RIGHT NOW...

1733
01:24:17,220 --> 01:24:18,621
I'D FLOAT AWAY.

1734
01:24:19,955 --> 01:24:22,591
YOU'RE MY BEST FRIEND,
AND NOW YOU'RE A GUY.

1735
01:24:22,625 --> 01:24:25,361
IT'S MEANT TO BE.

1736
01:24:25,394 --> 01:24:27,996
[ SIGHS ]

1737
01:24:30,766 --> 01:24:32,935
APRIL...

1738
01:24:32,968 --> 01:24:35,404
YOU DON'T NEED ME
OR ANY GUY

1739
01:24:35,604 --> 01:24:38,374
TO MAKE YOU FEEL
BEAUTIFUL AND SPECIAL...

1740
01:24:38,407 --> 01:24:40,743
BECAUSE YOU ARE.

1741
01:24:40,776 --> 01:24:44,647
YOU ARE THE GREATEST GIRL
IN THE WHOLE WORLD.

1742
01:24:46,249 --> 01:24:48,817
YOU ARE ALL YOU NEED.

1743
01:24:48,851 --> 01:24:52,821
I KNOW IT'S CRAZY,
BUT I CAN'T HELP IT.

1744
01:24:52,855 --> 01:24:54,790
I'M IN LOVE WITH YOU,
SPENCE.

1745
01:24:59,094 --> 01:25:01,330
[ SIGHS ]

1746
01:25:06,001 --> 01:25:08,036
[ SIGHS ]

1747
01:25:24,287 --> 01:25:25,688
APRIL...

1748
01:25:27,856 --> 01:25:29,458
YOU GONNA BE OKAY?

1749
01:25:29,492 --> 01:25:31,394
I'M SORRY.

1750
01:25:31,627 --> 01:25:33,128
DON'T BE.

1751
01:25:36,799 --> 01:25:39,001
WE'RE NOT GONNA LET
A LITTLE THING LIKE...

1752
01:25:39,034 --> 01:25:41,837
ME TURNING INTO A MAN
AND YOU WANTING TO BE WITH ME

1753
01:25:41,870 --> 01:25:44,106
GET IN THE WAY
OF OUR FRIENDSHIP, ARE WE?

1754
01:25:44,139 --> 01:25:45,674
[ CHUCKLES ]

1755
01:25:52,581 --> 01:25:54,917
[ SIGHS ]
I'M IN LOVE WITH BILLY.

1756
01:25:56,985 --> 01:25:59,121
AND IF I'M GONNA BE
STUCK LIKE THIS FOREVER,

1757
01:25:59,154 --> 01:26:03,559
HE'S JUST GONNA HAVE TO
ACCEPT ME AS I AM --

1758
01:26:03,759 --> 01:26:06,061
A MAN.

1759
01:26:10,199 --> 01:26:12,735
THAT'S MY MAN.

1760
01:26:12,768 --> 01:26:15,371
[ DANCE MUSIC PLAYS ]

1761
01:26:15,404 --> 01:26:17,706
I THINK I KNOW
WHO'S IN JESSICA'S BODY.

1762
01:26:17,740 --> 01:26:18,807
[ GASPS ]

1763
01:26:18,841 --> 01:26:20,843
AND I KNOW
WHERE WE CAN FIND HIM.

1764
01:26:20,876 --> 01:26:23,145
LET'S FIND JESSICA
AND GET OUT OF HERE.

1765
01:26:23,178 --> 01:26:26,815
HILDENBURG,
YOU KNOW WHAT TO DO.

1766
01:26:26,849 --> 01:26:28,217
COME ON.

1767
01:26:30,786 --> 01:26:33,789
[ MUSIC CONTINUES ]

1768
01:26:37,192 --> 01:26:38,427
AAH!

1769
01:26:43,599 --> 01:26:45,100
COME ON.

1770
01:26:45,133 --> 01:26:47,202
[ WHIP CRACKING ]
Man: THAT'S A HUGE BITCH.

1771
01:26:47,236 --> 01:26:49,171
[ LAUGHS ]
I DIDN'T SEE IT COMING.

1772
01:26:49,204 --> 01:26:51,740
NO WAY, MAN.
[ LAUGHS ]

1773
01:26:51,774 --> 01:26:53,909
[ WHISTLES ]
SCOOT. HE'S MINE.

1774
01:26:53,942 --> 01:26:55,578
MMM, BOY,
I DON'T THINK SO.

1775
01:26:55,611 --> 01:26:56,745
AAH!

1776
01:26:56,779 --> 01:26:58,247
[ SIGHS ]

1777
01:26:58,281 --> 01:27:00,583
[ EXHALES SHARPLY ]
GET AWAY!

1778
01:27:00,616 --> 01:27:02,117
BILLY...

1779
01:27:02,150 --> 01:27:04,487
IT'S ME -- JESSICA.

1780
01:27:06,955 --> 01:27:08,891
IT'S ALWAYS BEEN ME.

1781
01:27:08,924 --> 01:27:10,259
MISTER...

1782
01:27:10,293 --> 01:27:12,027
YOU'RE FREAKING ME OUT.

1783
01:27:12,060 --> 01:27:14,463
YOU KNOW HOW
WHEN I TOUCH YOU THERE,

1784
01:27:14,497 --> 01:27:16,732
IT MAKES YOUR WHOLE LEG
TINGLE?

1785
