AND WHEN
I TOUCH YOU HERE...

1786
01:27:22,771 --> 01:27:25,574
NO. NO.
NO, IT CAN'T BE.

1787
01:27:25,608 --> 01:27:28,210
DO YOU REMEMBER
AFTER THE HOMECOMING GAME...

1788
01:27:28,243 --> 01:27:31,547
AFTER YOU THREW THE WINNING PASS
TO BEAT CARLMONT,

1789
01:27:31,580 --> 01:27:34,082
YOU AND I WENT
BEHIND THE SCOREBOARD AND...

1790
01:27:34,116 --> 01:27:36,585
[ EXHALES SHARPLY ]

1791
01:27:37,986 --> 01:27:41,590
[ WHISPERING ]

1792
01:27:41,624 --> 01:27:43,592
[ EXHALES SHARPLY ]

1793
01:27:48,997 --> 01:27:51,400
[ EXHALES SHARPLY ]

1794
