BU-- I --
YOU'RE A 30-YEAR-OLD DUDE!

1804
01:28:35,978 --> 01:28:37,413
JUST ON THE OUTSIDE!

1805
01:28:38,914 --> 01:28:40,616
BILLY!

1806
01:28:40,649 --> 01:28:42,050
[ FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING ]
BIL--

1807
