IT'LL BE FINE.
ARE YOU SURE
SHE'S ALL RIGHT?

1810
01:28:49,758 --> 01:28:50,559
I'M SURE EVERYTHING'S
GONNA BE FINE.
BOOGER!

1811
01:28:50,593 --> 01:28:52,060
BOOGER, HURRY UP!

1812
01:28:52,094 --> 01:28:53,896
COME ON, BUDDY!

1813
01:28:53,929 --> 01:28:55,798
YOU GOT TO LEARN TO
RUN IN THOSE HEELS
IF YOU'RE GONNA WEAR THEM.

1814
01:28:55,831 --> 01:28:58,734
[ ENGINE TURNS OVER ]

1815
01:28:58,767 --> 01:29:00,736
[ SISTER SLEDGE'S "HE'S
