1816
01:29:00,769 --> 01:29:03,305
* OH, WHAT, WOW

1817
01:29:03,338 --> 01:29:05,574
* HE'S THE GREATEST DANCER
THERE YOU GO, SWEETHEART.

1818
01:29:05,608 --> 01:29:07,242
* THAT I'VE EVER SEEN

1819
01:29:07,275 --> 01:29:09,244
* I'VE EVER SEEN
[ LAUGHS ]

1820
01:29:09,277 --> 01:29:11,146
* OH, WHAT, WOW
[ GRUNTS ]

1821
01:29:11,179 --> 01:29:13,382
* HE'S THE GREATEST DANCER

1822
01:29:13,416 --> 01:29:15,083
* OH, WHAT, WOW

1823
01:29:15,117 --> 01:29:15,918
* THAT I'VE EVER SEEN

1824
01:29:15,951 --> 01:29:17,620
OH, SHIT!

1825
01:29:20,589 --> 01:29:21,757
[ EXHALES SHARPLY ]

1826
01:29:23,759 --> 01:29:26,395
I KNEW IT WAS GONNA BE
A GOOD NIGHT.

1827
01:29:26,429 --> 01:29:28,196
OW! GOD.

1828
01:29:28,230 --> 01:29:29,898
THANKS, HILDENBURG.

1829
01:29:29,932 --> 01:29:32,267
I WANT MY BODY BACK
RIGHT NOW!

1830
01:29:32,300 --> 01:29:35,871
WELL, FINDERS KEEPERS,
SWEETHEART.

1831
01:29:35,904 --> 01:29:37,105
[ LIGHTER CLICKS ]

1832
01:29:39,141 --> 01:29:42,010
HOW DARE YOU?! DO YOU KNOW WHAT
THIS COULD DO TO MY LUNGS?!

1833
01:29:42,044 --> 01:29:43,446
[ SCOFFS ]

1834
01:29:43,479 --> 01:29:45,280
YOU GIVE ME THAT EARRING!
GIVE ME THAT EARRING!

1835
01:29:45,481 --> 01:29:46,915
YOU GIVE ME THAT EARRING.

1836
01:29:46,949 --> 01:29:49,084
GIVE IT TO ME. GIVE IT.
GIVE IT TO ME.

1837
01:29:49,117 --> 01:29:50,419
OKAY. OKAY, OKAY, OKAY.

1838
01:29:50,453 --> 01:29:53,055
SIT DOWN.
CALM DOWN. CALM DOWN.

1839
01:29:53,088 --> 01:29:54,723
I'LL MAKE YOU A DEAL,
OKAY?

1840
01:29:54,757 --> 01:29:56,925
NOW...

1841
01:29:56,959 --> 01:29:59,862
JUST LET ME MAKE ANOTHER
500 BUCKS TONIGHT, OKAY?

1842
01:29:59,895 --> 01:30:02,731
AND THEN I'LL GIVE YOU
YOUR BODY BACK

1843
01:30:02,765 --> 01:30:04,867
'CAUSE IT'S
SO IMPORTANT TO YOU.

1844
01:30:04,900 --> 01:30:07,169
[ Mockingly ]
"I'M CRYING ABOUT MY BODY."

1845
01:30:07,402 --> 01:30:09,271
AND THEN...

1846
01:30:09,304 --> 01:30:11,540
YOU CAN JUST LOAN IT TO ME
EVERY OTHER WEEKEND

1847
01:30:11,574 --> 01:30:13,909
AND -- SO I CAN PAY OFF
SOME GAMBLING DEBTS.

1848
01:30:14,109 --> 01:30:16,579
WEEKENDS --
LOAN YOU MY BODY.

1849
01:30:16,612 --> 01:30:18,146
[ CHUCKLES ]

1850
01:30:18,180 --> 01:30:19,748
I WANT MY BODY BACK!

1851
01:30:19,782 --> 01:30:22,117
GIVE ME MY BODY BACK!

1852
01:30:22,150 --> 01:30:23,251
GIVE --
[ CHOKING ]

1853
01:30:24,152 --> 01:30:25,320
HEY...

1854
01:30:25,353 --> 01:30:27,490
LOOK AT ME.

1855
01:30:27,523 --> 01:30:29,492
I'M ONLY GONNA
TELL YOU THIS ONCE --

1856
01:30:29,525 --> 01:30:33,128
NO STRANGLING THE DANCERS
OR YOU ARE OUT OF HERE!

1857
01:30:33,161 --> 01:30:35,197
NOW, CAN'T YOU READ?

1858
