I GOT TO HIT THE HEAD.

1862
01:30:49,277 --> 01:30:51,413
* GIVE IT TO ME

1863
01:30:51,446 --> 01:30:53,181
* LIFE IS WHAT YOU MAKE IT

1864
01:30:53,215 --> 01:30:54,650
* AND IT CAN PASS YOU BY

1865
01:30:54,683 --> 01:30:56,451
HEY, DON'T WORRY.

1866
01:30:56,485 --> 01:30:58,353
WE'RE GONNA GET HIM.

1867
