[ GASPS ]

1868
01:31:02,124 --> 01:31:03,458
[ ALL LAUGHING ]

1869
01:31:04,527 --> 01:31:05,761
HEY, BABE.

1870
01:31:05,794 --> 01:31:07,362
[ WHISTLES ] SWEETHEART.

1871
01:31:07,395 --> 01:31:08,997
HEY...

1872
