NO WAY!

1873
01:31:11,667 --> 01:31:14,302
JESSICA?!
THIS IS WHERE YOU'VE BEEN?

1874
01:31:14,336 --> 01:31:15,470
[ LAUGHING ]

1875
01:31:15,504 --> 01:31:17,606
I WANT A DANCE FROM YOU!

1876
01:31:17,640 --> 01:31:18,941
YE-E-E-AH!

1877
01:31:18,974 --> 01:31:19,875
MAR--

1878
01:31:19,908 --> 01:31:21,009
OH.

1879
01:31:21,677 --> 01:31:22,811
UGH! OH!

1880
01:31:22,845 --> 01:31:24,980
[ EXHALES RAPIDLY ]

1881
