WHY WOULDN'T IT BE?

1884
01:31:33,188 --> 01:31:35,223
WHERE DO YOU KEEP
YOUR WEED, THOUGH?

1885
01:31:36,692 --> 01:31:39,361
* GIVE IT TO ME,
GIVE IT TO ME *

1886
01:31:39,394 --> 01:31:41,664
OHHHH.

1887
01:31:41,697 --> 01:31:44,232
THAT'S GOOD.

1888
01:31:44,432 --> 01:31:47,369
I DON'T HAVE ONE OF THOSE.

1889
01:31:47,402 --> 01:31:49,271
SURE.

1890
01:31:51,840 --> 01:31:54,409
[ ROMANTIC MUSIC PLAYS ]

1891
01:32:02,450 --> 01:32:04,252
[ SIGHS ]

1892
01:32:04,286 --> 01:32:05,921
BYE, SPENCE.

1893
01:32:08,223 --> 01:32:10,826
YOU'LL ALWAYS BE
MY BEST FRIEND.

1894
01:32:10,859 --> 01:32:12,595
FOREVER.

1895
01:32:12,628 --> 01:32:14,730
[ SIGHS ]

1896
01:32:19,735 --> 01:32:21,269
[ EXHALES SHARPLY ]

1897
01:32:21,303 --> 01:32:23,071
[ LAUGHS ]

1898
