1922
01:33:11,954 --> 01:33:13,421
* AAH

1923
01:33:13,455 --> 01:33:14,857
* MORE THAN A WOMAN

1924
01:33:15,090 --> 01:33:16,224
* YE-E-E-E-AH

1925
01:33:16,258 --> 01:33:17,660
[ BOING! ]

1926
01:33:17,693 --> 01:33:19,594
OH! OH! OH!

1927
01:33:19,628 --> 01:33:22,564
UH-HUH.

1928
01:33:22,597 --> 01:33:26,068
* MORE THAN A WOMAN

